<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id">- Matengo Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Joshua</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu saka Joshua</para>
  <para style="toc2">Joshua</para>
  <para style="toc3">Josh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabu saka</para>
  <para style="mt1">Joshua</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu saka Joshua kiendalee kulandi majambu gi likundi la Aizilaeli pandu pa salindaki kitabu su Kukomboka Malagalaki. Bandu buku Izilaeli atumbuli upandi golijingi lyoba wa losi luku Yoludani. Kitabu sa Joshua sutulandi namuna hebalombuka losi lwa Yoludani na kwaawesa bandu bunndema uku Kaanani kupete ulongosi waka Joshua nndisi waka Musa. Bahenga hela ndaba Sapanga jwatei kunndagalaki jombi. Sapanga jwahenga hela ndaba jwabia julagani lilaganu lejwaalagila kwaapeke nndema uku Kanaani kibeleku saka Ibulaimu. Linga mu kitabu su utumbuli 12:7.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngasejumanyikini mundu jojuandiki nu kupanga sapi kitabu saka Joshua. Mu ipindi yengi mundu julonge ngati najombi jwabii kati ja bandu baabi mu kitabu hesi. Linga Joshua 5:1-6. Kwa ndaba heji, abolewa bingi ba majambu ga Bibilia awasali kubanga Joshua mweni ndi jojuandiki pandu pakolongu pi kitabu senze. Kulangi kabe hotuhotu jubii kabe mundu jongi ndalindali na Joshua juandiki pandu pangi pasokopi pi kitabu senze, ngati pandu papalangi kuwa nu kusikwa kwaka Joshua. Linga lipungu la 24:29. Abolewa bingi ahobale kitabu saka Joshua saandikwi yaka mia nani yeipetiki baada ja majambu haga kupitii. Majambu gabagalogwi mu kitabu saka Joshua kuwesikana gapiiti mu saka sa 1250 kabula jukusaliwa Kilisitu, Jejuje kuwesikana yaka alubaini baada ja Falau Lamesesi kutumbuli kulongosa ku Misili. Kuhobaleka Lamesesi hoju ndi Bambu nkolongu jo jwalongua nndema uku Misili kipindi Aizilaeli pababia ahuma ku Misili. Linga kitabu su (Kuboka 1:11).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabii nkati</para>
  <para style="io">Lipungu 1 mbaka lipungu la 5:12 jutulandi namuna Aizilaeli hebalombuka losi lwa Yoludani nu kujingi mu nndema uku Kaanani.</para>
  <para style="io">Ndienu lipungu la 5:13 mbaka 12 lutulandi majambu ga Aizilaeli ahenga mipangu ja kwaakamu na kwaalapu bandu bu nndema uku Kaanani.</para>
  <para style="io">Lipungu lengi 13-21 lilandi namuna nndema Kanaani hebugubana nndema kwa makabila goti komi na mabeli guku Izilaeli.</para>
  <para style="io">Na mwisu, lipungu la 22-24 namuna makabila gangi hegakelabukia upandi golipiiti lyoba wa losi Yoludani, malobi ga mwisu gaka Yoshua kwa bandu buku izilaeli na kuwa kwaki nu kusikwa kwaki, na namuna Aizilaeli hebakelubukiya lilaganu labu na Bambu Sapanga.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOS 1" />
  <para style="s">Sapanga anndagalaki Joshua kugunyaga nndema uku Kanani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 1:1" />Pajakuwa Musa ntumisi waka Bambu Sapanga, Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Joshua mwana waka Nuni jojabii anzangati Musa, <verse eid="JOS 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 1:2" />“Musa ntumisi wangu jukuwiki, henu wehapa pamu na Aizilaeli boti nndobuka losi lwa Yoludani nzenda mbaka ku nndema gonumpeke. <verse eid="JOS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 1:3" />Kila pandu pamwakakanyata numpeki mwanganya ngati enunndagalakia Musa. <verse eid="JOS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 1:4" />Mipaka ju nndema jiibia ana, upandi u kusini mwiipakana nu lukoba nu upandi uku kazikazini wiipakana ni itombi ya Lebanoni. Upandi golipiti lyoba mwiipakana na losi lobulukema Efulati nu ndema gwoti gwa bandu babakema Ahiti mbaka kunhanga nkolongu uku Meditelenia upandi golijingii lyoba. <verse eid="JOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 1:5" />Ngajwiikubi mundu jojwaguwesa masoba goti ga womi waku. Niikuba pamu na wehapa ngati enabi na Musa. Masoba goti niikuba na wehapa wala nganaguleki hata kulenga nabwaka. <verse eid="JOS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 1:6" />Gubiya nganganganga na gubiya na moju gukuwesa ndaba wehapa walongusa bandu aba kujenda kujuku nndema gonaalagi aseja babu kubanga niitenda kwaapeke. <verse eid="JOS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 1:7" />Ila gujemakia nganganganga na gukuba na mwoju gukuwesa gulingalakia nu kuhenga malagalaki goti gajugulagakia ntumisi wa Musa. Wiikotoka kuhenga kila lilagalaki nawe wiwesa kupata segupala kila pandu pawijenda. <verse eid="JOS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 1:8" />Gulingalakia ngamaa wakijewa kitabu senze sa malagalaki ila kila lisoba ulibola kitabu senze mui ni ikilu ili guwesa kuhenga goti gahandiki momu, nawe gwiipata kila segupala nukuneng'ane pokapi pa gwijenda. <verse eid="JOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 1:9" />Kombuka nepani nugulagalaki gubia nganganganga na gubia na moju gukuwesa. Gwijogopa wala kusoka ndaba nepani Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, mi pamu nawepa pokapi pagujenda.”<verse eid="JOS 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joshua jwaalagalaki bandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 1:10" />Ndienu, Joshua jwaalagalakia akakilongosi ba akomana ngondu, <verse eid="JOS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 1:11" />kujenda mu makambi nakwaapwagi bandu, “Nhandia posu, ndaba egiipeta masoba matatu mwilobuka losi lwa Yoludani, kujenda kutama ndema gogugwe Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu ampeki kuba mali gino.”<verse eid="JOS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 1:12" />Joshua jwaapwagila bandu bi likabila laka Lubeni ni likabila la Gadi na nusu ji likabila la Manase, <verse eid="JOS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 1:13" />“Nkombuka lijambu lejunndagalakia Musa ntumisi waka Bambu Sapanga, jundagalakia kupwaaga, ‘Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jwampekia pandu pukupomule, nukumpekee nndema gongo gu upandi golipitii liyoba.’ <verse eid="JOS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 1:14" />Akahanu binu na bana binu ni mipugu iigalia mu nndema goampekia Musa mwanganya upandi golipiti lyoba uku Yoludani. Lakini akanalomi boti baabi nu uwesu gukukomana ngondu baabii tayali kukomana biiloboka losi koni abi na hindu yu kukomane ngondu nu kwaalongule alongu binu. Kupalika kwaajangati alongu bii, <verse eid="JOS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 1:15" />mbaka Bambu Sapanga pajaapekia alongu binu kabee pandu pukupumule, ngati eampekia mbanganya, nabombi abia nu nndema gojwampekia Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu. Ndienu mwiikelubuka mu nndema kulisa mali gino na bumpekii mwanganya, nndema goguwe jumpeki Musa ntumisi waka Bambu Sapanga, ju upandi golipita lyoba mwa losi luku Yoludani.”<verse eid="JOS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 1:16" />Ndienu bunzibua Joshua, “Majambu goti gautulagalaki mbaka tuhengi, na pokapi pawatutuma mbaka tujendi. <verse eid="JOS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 1:17" />Twagujoaninya wehapa ngati etunzogwania Musa mu majambu goti na Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wako jubia pamu na weapa ngati ejabi pamu na Musa. <verse eid="JOS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 1:18" />Mundu jokapi jojwisinda kupwata malagalaki gaku au kukana kujowane malobi gaku au lijambu lokapi leunndagalaki, jwiitenda kukomeka. Lakini weapa, gubia nganganganga na mwoju gukuwesa.”<verse eid="JOS 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOS 2" />
  <para style="s">Joshua jwaatuma bandu bukulaluki majambu ku Yeliku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 2:1" />Enu, Joshua mwana jwaka Nuni, jwaatuma bandu abeli kwa sili kuhuma ku Shitimu bajenda kulaluki majambu gunndema gola, bakalalukiya ngani kumusi uku Yeliku. Batenda kujenda, bahika mu nyumba jaka mmbomba nselati joakema Lahabu, bagonila momu.<verse eid="JOS 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 2:2" />Bambu nkolongu juku musi uku Yeliku bumpwagila, akanalomi buku Izilaeli ajingi mumusi ikilu jalelenu ili kulaluki majambu gu nndema goni. <verse eid="JOS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 2:3" />Bambu nkolongu juku Yeliku jwaatuma bandu kwaka Lahabu, nukumpwagi. “Waapia kunza bandu bahikiki nnyumba jaku ndaba ahikiki kulaluki majambu gu nndema gwoti.”<verse eid="JOS 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 2:4" />Lakini, mmbomba jola jwabia jwaahihiki bandu abeli bala. Enu, jwaapwagila bandu bajwaatumiki bala, “Sakaka bandu haba bahikiki kwane, lakini nepani ngasemanyiki ahumiki kwako. <verse eid="JOS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 2:5" />Kipindi sukujigi litanga la musi, palajingala lwihii, bandu haba batenda kubokane, kobajenda ngasenukumanye. Mwapwata kanyata pangi mbaka mwaakamu.” <verse eid="JOS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 2:6" />Lakini Lahabu jwabia jwaakwelisi kunhagaa bandu baalaluki majambu gu nndema bala nakwaahia mu makenda ga mapei gabatandiki kunhaga je kola. <verse eid="JOS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 2:7" />Enu, bandu bajwaatumiki bambu nkolongu bala baapwata kupete indela yeijenda ku mitandu ja Yoludani. Apalapala ebaboka mu musi, litanga la musi latenda kupungwa. <verse eid="JOS 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 2:8" />Kabula bandu baalaluki majambu gu nndema bala ngaseagoni ikilu, Lahabu jwaajendila kunhagaa, <verse eid="JOS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 2:9" />jwaapwagila, “Nepani manyiki kuba Bambu Sapanga ampekii nndema gongo, na twe lutukamwi lujogopu ndaba jinu na bandu boti bunndema gongo atei kulepatuka ndaba jinu mmbanganya. <verse eid="JOS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 2:10" />Ndaba tujogwini Bambu Sapanga ejwagahenga masi gunhanga nkolongu gwa Shamu gajoma pamwahuma nndema guku Misili, na emwaatendi aka bambu akolongu abeli Aamoli bababi upandi golipiti lyoba uku Yoludani, jomunkema Sihoni na Ogu babube mwaakoma tipitipi. <verse eid="JOS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 2:11" />Etajogwana tu majambu haga, twatenda kulepetuka ndaba jinu mwanganya na twajomukania makili tipitipi. Henu sajenu manyiki Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wino, ndi Sapanga ju kunani na pai punndema! <verse eid="JOS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 2:12" />Enu, mpepa nnapila nepani kwilihina laka Bambu Sapanga, kubanga musindendila gaamboni nepani na aka alongu bango, ngati enunhengi gaamboni mwanganya kabee nnangia nginyuli ana ngiti nhenga sakaka. <verse eid="JOS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 2:13" />Nnagila kubanga mwaahokua atati bangu na anyongo bangu, aka alombu na aka ahasa bango naka alongu boti! Mwatuleka tukuwaje.”<verse eid="JOS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 2:14" />Bandu bala bajibua, “Sapanga jutukoma ana ngatuhengi setupwagani! Ana nga wampwagi mundu jokapi kupete sili jitu, Bambu Sapanga ejwatupekia nndema gongo, twagutendila kwa waamboni na su kuhobaleka.”<verse eid="JOS 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 2:15" />Enu, Lahabu jwaahulua bandu bala kulugoji kupete pilindilisa, ndaba nyumba jaki jwasengiki pambipi nu lumatu lwa musi gwa Yeliku. <verse eid="JOS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 2:16" />Jwaapwagila, “Nzendania mu nndema gwiitombi mukajoba ili babumpwata bankole. Mwitamania koko masoba matatu, mbaka babumpwata pabikuba akelabwiki pa musi, ndienu mwijendania.” <verse eid="JOS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 2:17" />Bandu bala bunnzibua, “Twiihenga ngati etulapani. <verse eid="JOS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 2:18" />Patwagutukaliya nndema waku goni wiihenga ana, wiikonga lugoji lukeli londone mu lindilisa legutuhulukia. Gwaaleta kwaku atati baku na akamabu baku na akalombu baku na akalongu baku boti ba atati baku. <verse eid="JOS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 2:19" />Lakini mundu jwokapi anajupitiki kunza ja nyumba jaku ngatuhusiki nu kuwa kwaki. Lakini ngati mundu jwokapi jojibia nkati ja nyumba jaku anaanhumisi pe, likosa lukukomwa kwaki twitotula twepani. <verse eid="JOS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 2:20" />Lakini anagumpwagi mundu jokapi lihengu litu ale, kulapa kotulapani kwibiya kuhogwiki.” <verse eid="JOS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 2:21" />Najombi jwaapwagila, “Nyetaki, kubia ngati empwagiki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 2:21">Ndienu jwaaleka aboka, na bombi batenda kuboka. Najwombi jwakonga lugoji lukeli lola mu lindilisa.<verse eid="JOS 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 2:22" />Bandu baalaluki majambu gu nndema bala baboka bajenda kukitombi nukulijoba. Batama kola masoba matatu mbaka babaataputa bala pabakelubuka ku musi guku Yeliku, baada jakwataputa nu kusindwa kwa bona. <verse eid="JOS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 2:23" />Enu bandu baalaluki majambu gu nndema abeli bala bahelala kuhuma kukitombi, balobuka losi nukunzendee Joshua mwana waka Nuni na basimulia goti gagaapatiki. <verse eid="JOS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 2:24" />Bumpwagila Joshua, “Sakaka Bambu Sapanga jutupeki twepani nndema goni gwoti, ndaba bandu boti bunndema gola butujogopa twepani.”<verse eid="JOS 2:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOS 3" />
  <para style="s">Aizalaeli aloboka losi luku Yoludani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 3:1" />Lisoba lelapwata lukela ngani Joshua pamu na bandu boti buku Izalaeli batumbuliya sapwali kuhuma ku Sitimu. Pabahika kulosi luku Yoludani, babeka kambi koni alendale kuloboka kwie. <verse eid="JOS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 3:2" />Egapeta masoba matatu, akakilongosi bapeta pikilanda ja makambi gala, <verse eid="JOS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 3:3" />baapwagila bandu, “Pamwalibona Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, atotwi aka agolu babube kibeleku sa Alawi, mpitaninya nu kulipwata. <verse eid="JOS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 3:4" />Hela ndi emwajimanya indela jukupeta ndaba ngase nhwaiki kupeta hata lisoba limu. Lakini mwiihegalee ngani Lisanduku li Lilaganu, mwibiya munyuma ngati kilumita jimu helahe.”<verse eid="JOS 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 3:5" />Joshua jwaapwagila bandu, “Mwilisapisa ili kujetakewa kunndumbali Bambu Sapanga ndaba kilabu jwiitenda ndonduke pikilanda jino.” <verse eid="JOS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 3:6" />Ndienu jwaapwagila akaagolu, “Nzukua Lisanduku li lilaganu, nndongulia nalu palongi ja bandu.” Nabombi batola nukulongule nalu palongi ja bandu.<verse eid="JOS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 3:7" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Joshua, “Lelenu, ndumbuli kugulangi kwa bandu kubanga wehapa ukilongosi nkolongu palongi ja bandu boti Aizalaeli ili amanya kubanga ngati enabi pamu na Musa ndi eniibiya pamu na weapa. <verse eid="JOS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 3:8" />Gwalagalakiya aka agolu haba baatoto Lisanduku li Lilaganu pabiika pa losi ja Yoludani ajema mmasi pulutengu ja losi.”<verse eid="JOS 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 3:9" />Ndienu Joshua jwaapwagila Aizilaeli, “Nhegalia pambipi ili nzogwanakia malobi gaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wino. <verse eid="JOS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 3:10" />Sakaka Bambu Sapanga jojubii mwomi jaabenga pikilanda jinu, Akanani na Ahiti na Ahivi na Apelishi na Agiligashi na Aamoli na Ayebusi. Nanamu mwiimanya sakaka Sapanga jojubii mwomi jubii pikilanda jinu, <verse eid="JOS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 3:11" />Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu ju nndema gwoti, palanndonguliya kuloboka losi lwa Yoludani. <verse eid="JOS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 3:12" />Henu, nhagula akanalomi komi na abeli kuhuma mu kila likabila ga Aizalaeli, kila likabila jupita mundu jumwa. <verse eid="JOS 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 3:13" />Yaji yaka agolu baatoto Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga, Bambu junndema gwoti, paijingala nkati ja masi ga losi lwa Yoludani, masi ga losi holu giikotuka kunyika. Nagaganyika kuhuma upandi gu kundonda gilundikana pamu ngati kihogo.”<verse eid="JOS 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 3:14" />Enu bandu baboka mu makambi gabu ili kujenda kuloboka losi lwa Yoludani, nabombi aka agolu koni atotwi Lisanduku li lilaganu baalongulia bandu haba. <verse eid="JOS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 3:15" />Sabiya kipindi sukuhusa na losi lwabiya lutweli ngamaa. Lakini baatotwi Lisanduku li Lilaganu ebajingala pe mu losi lwa Yoludani, <verse eid="JOS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 3:16" />masi gaganyika kuhuma upandi gukundonda gajema na kuba ngati kihogo gatwelela mbaka kukijiji suku Adamu sesabi pambipi na musi gwa Saletani. Masi gaganyika kujenda kunhanga guku Alaba, goguwe kabee bugukema nhanga gwa mwinyu gajomaliya ngani. Ndienu bandu balobuka kujenda pambipi na musi uku Yeliku. <verse eid="JOS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 3:17" />Aizalaeli pababia atenda kulomboka, aka agolu bababia atotwi Lisanduku li Lilaganu bajema pandu pajomu pikilanda ja losi lwa Yoludani mbaka bandu boti pabajomula kulomboka.<verse eid="JOS 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOS 4" />
  <para style="s">Malibu komi na mabeli gukukombukela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 4:1" />Bandu boti buku Izilaeli pabajomula kuloboka losi lwa Yoludani, Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Joshua, <verse eid="JOS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 4:2" />“Nhagula akanalomi komi na abeli kuhuma mu kila likabila la Aizalaeli, kila likabila jupita mundu jumwa. <verse eid="JOS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 4:3" />Gwaalagalakia ana, ‘Nzukua malibu komi na gabeli kuhuma pikilanda ja losi lwa Yoludani, kuhuma paajemiki aka agolu. Mugajukua malibu haga, mkagabeka pandu pamwakagonila lelenu.’ ”<verse eid="JOS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 4:4" />Ndipala Joshua jwaakema akanalomi komi na abeli bala babahagwi kati ja Aizalaeli, kila likabila mundu jumu, <verse eid="JOS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 4:5" />jwaapwagila, “Mwililongulia Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wino, nzenda mbaka pikilanda ja losi Yoludani, kila jumu wino jutotula lilibu pilibega laki, lilibu limu ndaba ja kila likabila la Aizalaeli. <verse eid="JOS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 4:6" />Malibu haga gabia sindu sukutukombuke kwitu twepani na bana binu pabandalukia masoba gagahika, ‘Boo, malibu aga gabi na mana boo kwino?’ <verse eid="JOS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 4:7" />Mbanganya mwaapwagila, ‘Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga palabii bilipetesa kulosi lwa Yoludani, masi ga losi holu gatenda kujema ngaseganyikike!’ Henu malibu ganga gibiya ukombuke kwa Aizalaeli masoba ganga na mwisu.”<verse eid="JOS 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 4:8" />Akanalomi bala bahenga ngati ejaalagalakia Joshua, bajukua malibu komi na mabeli kuhuma pikilanda ja losi lwa Yoludani, lilibu limu ndaba ji likabila la Aizilaeli, ngati Bambu Sapanga eandagalakiya Joshua, bajenda naku mbaka ku makambi gabu nukugatola pala. <verse eid="JOS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 4:9" />Kabee Joshua jajukua malibu gangi komi na mabeli nu kugajemeka pikilanda ja losi lwa Yoludani, pandu payajemiki yaji yaka agolu babatotwi Lisanduku li Lilaganu. Malibu haga gabi hoku mbaka lelenu.<verse eid="JOS 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 4:10" />Akagolu bala babatotwi Lisanduku li Lilaganu, bajemiki pikilanda ja losi lwa Yoludani mbaka bandu pabajomula kuhenga kila sindu sesuse Bambu Sapanga anndagalakia Joshua jwaapwagila bandu. Joshua jwahenga goti gaandagalakia Musa na bandu balombuka nyata kwii ja losi, <verse eid="JOS 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 4:11" />bandu boti pababia alobwiki, akagolu bala baatotwi Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga baalonguliya bandu boti. <verse eid="JOS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 4:12" />Akanalomi bi likabila la Lubeni ni likabila la Gadi na nusu ji likabila laka Manase baalongulia alongu babu Aizalaeli koni abi na hindu yabu yukukomane, ngati ejaalagalakia Musa. <verse eid="JOS 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 4:13" />Akanalomi elupu alubaini baabi na hindu yukukomane ngondu koni aliandii kukomana ngondu koni abii pamu na Bambu Sapanga bajenda ku ligomba la musi gwa Yeliku. <verse eid="JOS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 4:14" />Mwilisoba heli Bambu Sapanga anhenga Joshua jubiya mundu nkolongu kwa Aizalaeli boti, nabombi bunntendila isima Joshua masoba gaki goti ngati ebunhengila isima Musa.<verse eid="JOS 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 4:15" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Joshua, <verse eid="JOS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 4:16" />“Gwaalagalakia agolu batotwi Lisanduku li Lilaganu, apita ndosi ja Yoludani.” <verse eid="JOS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 4:17" />Enu, Joshua jaalagalakia akagolu bala kupwaga, “Mpitania nndosi ja Yoludani.” <verse eid="JOS 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 4:18" />Akagolu bala babatotwi Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga pabapita pikilanda ja losi lwa Yoludani, nukukanyati mu nkenga gwa losi na masi gatumbuliya kunyika nu kutwele kabee ngati pakwatumbulia. <verse eid="JOS 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 4:19" />Aizalaeli balobuka losi lwa Yoludani mu lisoba la komi la mwei gu kutumbuli, babeka kambi ku musi gwa Giligali, upandi golipita lyoba uku musi uku Yeliku. <verse eid="JOS 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 4:20" />Joshua jwahimika malibu komi na gabeli gala ku Giligali gababia ajukwi kuhuma kulosi lwa Yoludani. <verse eid="JOS 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 4:21" />Ndienu Joshua jwaapwagila Aizalaeli, “Bana bino ana andaluki masoba gagahika, ‘Boo, malibu aga gabi na mana boo kwino?’ <verse eid="JOS 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 4:22" />Mwaapwagila ana, ‘Bandu buku Izilaeli balobuka losi lwa Yoludani pandu pajomu.’” <verse eid="JOS 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 4:23" />Mwaapwagila, “Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wino, jugajomisa masi ga losi lwa Yoludani ndaba jino mbaka mwawesa kuloboka, ngati ejajomisa nhanga uku Shamu ndaba jitu. <verse eid="JOS 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 4:24" />Bambu Sapanga jwahenga hela ili bandu boti bunndema gwoti amanya Bambu Sapanga jubi na makili. Nanamu mu nndumbalia Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wino masoba ganga na mwisu.”<verse eid="JOS 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOS 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 5:1" />Akabambu boti ba Aamoli babatama kwii ju upandi go lijingi lyoba ku Yoludani na Akabambu boti bababia atama kui kumbwani ju nhanga nkolongu uku Meditelenia, ebajogwana kubanga Bambu Sapanga jugajomalisi masi ga losi lwa Yoludani mbaka Aizalaeli pabalobuka. Bajogopa na basoka makili gu kukomana na Aizilaeli.<verse eid="JOS 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aizalaeli asekuliwa jandu ku Giligali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 5:2" />Masoba gala, Bambu Sapanga apwagila Joshua, “Hongula malibu gaganonwipi ngamaa gabia mipamba ili gwaasekula jandu Aizalaeli bababi ngaseasekuliwi.” <verse eid="JOS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 5:3" />Enu, Joshua jwahongula malibu gala gabia mipamba na kwaaseku jandu Aizalaeli ku Gibea Haalaloti. <verse eid="JOS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 5:4" />Ndaba ja kwaaseku jandu Aizalaeli ndi jenze, Aizalaeli boti akanalomi babahuma ku Misili bababi na yaka yukutosa kujenda kukukomana ngondu, boti bakuwa nsapwali kulukoba pababia ahuma kunndema uku Misili. <verse eid="JOS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 5:5" />Babahuma ku Misili boti babiya asekuliwi jandu, lakini boti babasaliwa nsapwali kulukoba baada jukuhuma ku Misili, babiya bakona ngaseasekwi jandu. <verse eid="JOS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 5:6" />Aizalaeli bajenda nsapwali kwa yaka alubaini kulukoba hata akanalomi boti bababii na yaka yukuwesa kujenda kukomana ngondu bakuwa ndaba ngasebunzowanaki Bambu Sapanga. Bambu Sapanga jwabiya jwaalapi bandu haba kubanga ngabaguboni nndema wa sapi gogulengane kulema nu kupugi mipugu jingi goguwe jombi jwaalapila akatati babu kubanga jwiitenda kutupeke twepani. <verse eid="JOS 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 5:7" />Ndienu kwabiya bana ba bandu haba babube Bambu Sapanga jwaatunza badala jabu, haba ndi Joshua jwaasekwi jandu, bababia ngaseasekuliwi jandu ndaba babia mu sapwali kulukoba.<verse eid="JOS 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 5:8" />Akanalomi boti pababiya asekuliwi jandu batama mu makambi mbaka pabalama. <verse eid="JOS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 5:9" />Ndienu Bambu Sapanga apwagila Joshua, “Lelenu numboki iyoni yu utumwa yemwapata pamwabi ku Misili.” Enu pandu pala bapakema Giligali mbaka lelenu. Giligali maana jaki kuboka.<verse eid="JOS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 5:10" />Aizalaeli pababi ku Giligali babeka kambi hoku na batenda tipati ja Pasaka pakamii ji lisoba la komi nu nsesi ja mwei gu utumbuli mu ubamba guku Yeliku. <verse eid="JOS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 5:11" />Kilabu jaki baada ja Pasaka bakula mabumunda ganga kujege amila ni ilebi yeakalingi kulengana ni ilebi yu nndema gola. <verse eid="JOS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 5:12" />Enu, tumbuka lisoba lela pabakula ilebi yunndema gola Aizalaeli ngase bapata kabee posu jebijikema mana. Tumbuka saka sela Aizalaeli bakula ilebi yu nndema gwa Kanaani.<verse eid="JOS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joshua na mundu jojubii nu upanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 5:13" />Lisoba limu Joshua pajabi pambipi na musi guku Yeliku, jajitukia pe mundu jumu jujemiki palongi jaki koni jubii nu upanga mu kuboku jaki. Joshua anhegalia nu kundaluki, “Boo, weapa gunzito au jumu wa abaja bito?” <verse eid="JOS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 5:14" />Jombi azibua, “Ngaela, nepani nga nunzino wala nga nummbaja wino! Lakini nepani ndi nunkolongu jwa baakomana ngondu baka Sapanga.” Joshua jwajinama pai nukupega magoti kulangi isima, ndienu andalukia, “Bambu wangu, nepani ntumisi gwaku, gupala ndenda kike?” <verse eid="JOS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 5:15" />Nkolongu hoju jwa baakomana ngondu baka Sapanga ampwagila, “Hula sambali yaku ndaba pagujemiki je hapa pandu pasapi.” Joshua jwatenda hela.<verse eid="JOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOS 6" />
  <para style="s">Aizalaeli bugukamu musi uku Yeliku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 6:1" />Matanga gu kujingali musi gwa Yeliku babia bagajigi ili Aizalaeli biijingi. Nga mundu jojwawesa kujingi wala kupita kunza ja musi gwe hogu. <verse eid="JOS 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 6:2" />Ndienu Bambu Sapanga apwagila Joshua, “Lingaliya! Nepani nagubeka musi gwa Yeliku pamu na bambu nkolongu wa musi hogu na akaalonda baki babii na makili mu maboku gaku. <verse eid="JOS 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 6:3" />Gweapa na akomana ngondu baabi na hindu yukukomane mwaboti mwiyonguluta mala jimu kila lisoba nhenga hela kwa masoba sita. <verse eid="JOS 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 6:4" />Wibia na akagolu saba kila jumu jutotula imbata jaki ji linyelu li likondoo likambaku, biilongulia palongi Lisanduku li Lilaganu. Mulisoba la saba mwiiyongulata musi hogu mala saba koni akagolu ajemba imbata yabu. <verse eid="JOS 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 6:5" />Pabiipula imbata heyi kwa sauti ngolongu ngani na emwijogwana pe kekelele heyi, bandu boti biijamalia nakanopi nu lumatu lwa musi lwiabuka pai. Ndienu bandu baku bagukamula musi hogu kila mundu pandu pajujemiki.”<verse eid="JOS 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 6:6" />Enu Joshua, mwana waka Nuni jwaakema aka agolu na kwaapwagila, “Mwilitotula Lisanduku li Lilaganu na akagolu saba atotula imbata saba yi likondoo likambaku, alongulia palongi ji lisanduku heli.” <verse eid="JOS 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 6:7" />Joshua jwaalagalakia bandu, “Henu nzendania kulongo muguyonguluta musi, na bandu baabii na hindu yukukomane bililongulia Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga.”<verse eid="JOS 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 6:8" />Joshua hejwajomula kwaalagalakia bandu, akaagolu saba bala bababi ni imbata saba ya manyelu ga makondoo makambaku bajenda palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, koni apula imbata ni Lisanduku laka Bambu Sapanga laapwata kunnyuma. <verse eid="JOS 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 6:9" />Akomana ngondu bababi na hindu yukukomane baalongulia akaagolu bala babube bajemba imbata na akomana ngondu bangi babia munyuma ji Lisanduku heli, koni aendale kupula imbata. <verse eid="JOS 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 6:10" />Lakini Joshua jwaalagalakia bandu, “Mwiipega keleli, wala mwiipwaga sokapi, mbaka lisoba lenampwagila mpega keleli, ndi pamwiipega keleli.” <verse eid="JOS 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 6:11" />Enu Joshua jwaalagalakia bandu bala ayongulata musi mala jimu kila lisoba koni atotwi Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga nu kulikelebuka kugone mu makambi ikilu.<verse eid="JOS 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 6:12" />Joshua jwajumuka lukela ngani lisoba lelapwata nabombi akaagolu batotula Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="JOS 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 6:13" />Akaagolu saba bala bababi ni imbata saba ya makondoo makambaku balonguliya palongi ji Lisanduku laka Bambu Sapanga koni apula imbata sanga kukotoka. Akomana ngondu bababii na hindu yukukomane baalonguliya aka agolu bababia ni imbata na bandu bangi babia apwata kunyuma bilipwata Lisanduku na agolu baka Sapanga baendalia kupula imbata yabu. <verse eid="JOS 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 6:14" />Lisoba la pili bayonguluta musi hogu mala jimu, nukukelabuka ku makambi gabu. Bahenga hela kwa masoba sita. <verse eid="JOS 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 6:15" />Lisoba la saba, bajumuka pulukela ngani, lakini lisoba heli buguyonguluta musi hogu mala saba kwa namuna ajelaje. Labiya lisoba heli pena lebuguyongulata musi hogu mala saba. <verse eid="JOS 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 6:16" />Pabayonguluta mala ja saba, agolu ebabiya ajembiki imbata, Joshua jwaalagalakia bandu kupwaga, “Nzamaliya ndaba Bambu Sapanga ampeki nndema ago! <verse eid="JOS 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 6:17" />Musi ago pamu na kila sindu sekibii momu yiikomika ndaba biibekiki palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga kuba litambiku. Lakini Lahabu mmbomba nngoni jola, ndi jotwandeka pamu na boti bajubii nabu mu nyumba jaki ndaba jwahia bandu bitu ba ahikiki kulaluki majambu mu nndema goni. <verse eid="JOS 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 6:18" />Lakini mwiijuku sindu sokapi sebikibekiki palongi jaka Sapanga ili kukikoma ndaba ana nzukwii mwalihenga likambi loti la Ahebulania kuba litambiku lukutini nahela gibiya mang'aliku. <verse eid="JOS 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 6:19" />Lakini madini goti ga feza na zahabu na hindu ya shaba na isomasoma ndi ya sapi, kwaka Bambu Sapanga, enu mwiibeka mwikikoku kuba mali gaka Bambu Sapanga.”<verse eid="JOS 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 6:20" />Agolu bapula imbata na bandu pabajowania bakema kwa sauti, mimatu ja musi jatenda kuabuka. Apalapa bandu boka bugujendila musi gola na bandu boti bugukamula musi gola. <verse eid="JOS 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 6:21" />Ndienu bakoma ku upanga kila sindu sesabii mu musi je homu yani akanalomi na akambomba na akakombu na aseja na ng'ombi na makondoo na maponda.<verse eid="JOS 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 6:22" />Joshua jwaapwagila bandu abeli baalaluki bala babugulalukiya nndema hogu. “Nzendania mbaka nnyumba juku nselati jola, mukundeta mmbomba jola na akaalongu baki boti ngati emundapila.” <verse eid="JOS 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 6:23" />Enu, akakombu baalaluki bala batenda kujenda, andeta Lahabu na atati baki na amabu baki na akalongu baki na bandu boti babunhyongulata, baabeka kunza ja kambi ja Aizalaeli. <verse eid="JOS 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 6:24" />Ndienu, bugujosa mwotu musi gwoti gwa Yeliku na kila sindu sesabii kasolu pe madini ga feza na zahabu na hindu ya shaba na yiki somasoma, heyi biibeka mwikikoku sa nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="JOS 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 6:25" />Lakini nselati Lahabu pamu na bandu boti bu nnyumba ja atati baki, Joshua jwaaleka koni abii bomi. Lahabu jatama pamu na Aizalaeli mbaka lelenu, ndaba jwahiiki bandu baalaluki bala babube Joshua jwatuma kugulaluki musi gwa Yeliku.<verse eid="JOS 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 6:26" />Masoba gala Joshua jwaalakaliya palongi ja bandu kupwaga, “Mundu jokapi jojwiisenga kabe musi gwa Yeliku, jupata yambamba kuhuma kwaka Bambu Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 6:26">Jokapi jojibeka nsingi gwa musi gongo, mwana waki ju utumbuli jwiitendakuwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 6:26">Jokapi jojisenga litanga la musi hogu, mwana mundu jwa mwisu jwitenda kuwa.”<verse eid="JOS 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 6:27" />Enu, Bambu Sapanga jwabia pamu na Joshua na bandu boti bababia pambipi na Joshua batenda kummanya.<verse eid="JOS 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOS 7" />
  <para style="s">Mahakau gaka Akani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 7:1" />Lakini Aizalaeli ngasebabi bukuhobaleka kwa hindu yeapiiki litambiku ili kuikoma ndaba Akani jwajukua hindu yebalagalakiya litambiku ili kuitini. Ndienu inyela yaka Bambu Sapanga yabiya kwa Aizilaeli. Akani jwabia mwana waka Kalimi nsokoo waka Zabudi jojwahumila lukolu lwaka Zela ulikabila laka Yuda.<verse eid="JOS 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 7:2" />Joshua jwaatuma bandu kuhuma ku Yeliku kujenda ku musi gwa Ai, gogwabi pambipi na Beti aveni, upandi golipita lyoba gwa musi wa Beteli. Jwaapwagila, “Nzendania mukalalukiya majambu gu nndema.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 7:2">Ndienu bandu bala bajenda nukulaluki majambu gu nndema gola. <verse eid="JOS 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 7:3" />Pababuja kwaka Joshua bapwaga, “Nga lasima kwaatuma bandu boti kwaalapu bandu buku Ai, waatuma bandu elupu ibeli au elupu itatu pena. Waasumbu bandu boti baakomana ngondu kujenda kukomana kola, gola nga musi nkolongo.” <verse eid="JOS 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 7:4" />Enu bandu ngati elupu itatu helahe bajenda kukomana na bandu ba musi wa Ai, lakini bandu ba musi hogu batenda kwaabenga. <verse eid="JOS 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 7:5" />Bandu buku Ai baakoma Aizalaeli selasini na sita nakwaabenga kuhuma kwi litanga la musi mbaka ku Sebalimu, baakoma puhele. Aizalaeli babia nu lujogopu na basoka makili.<verse eid="JOS 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 7:6" />Joshua jwajendula ingobu yaki nukulileke pai palongi ji Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga jwatama pala mbaka pakamii. Nabombi aseja bahenga ahelahela bilijitalia luhombi mu mimutu jabu kulangi abii nu usungu. <verse eid="JOS 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 7:7" />Joshua jwapwaga, “Mwaa Bambu Sapanga! Ndaba jaki gutulobwisi losi lwa Yoludani nukutuleta mu maboku ga bandu buku Amoli ili butukomaje? Nambanga wakatuleka tuigalia pe kwii ja losi lwa Yoludani! <verse eid="JOS 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 7:8" />Mwaa Bambu, mbwaga kike ndaba Aizalaeli baatiliki abaja babo? <verse eid="JOS 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 7:9" />Enu, bandu buku Kanaani pamu na bandu bangi boti bu nndema gongo ebiimanya majambu aga biitenda kutu yongolota nukutuputa tipitipi pu nndema twiibonikana. Boo, enu misi gutenda kike ili kulangi gubii na makili?”<verse eid="JOS 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 7:10" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Joshua, “Jumuka! Ndaba jakii gulileki pai anana? <verse eid="JOS 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 7:11" />Aizalaeli atei mahakau, ndaba asindiki kupwata lilaganu lenaalagalaki alikamula. Ajukwi hindu yengi yeyatakiwa kutiniwa, ajibiki nu kupwaaga isoli nu kwiibeka pamu na hindu yabu. <verse eid="JOS 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 7:12" />Ndienu Aizilaeli ngaseawesa kwawesa abaja babu, baatila abaja babu ndaba bilihengiki beni kuba sindu sukutiniwa! Nganikubi pamu nabombi kabete anangasemmbohiki hindu yeibii kati jino yeyapikiwi kutiniwa. <verse eid="JOS 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 7:13" />Enu, jumuka waapwagila bandu alibeka sapi kunndumbali Bambu Sapanga ndaba ji lisoba li kilabu, nepani Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wabu, Sapanga jwa Aizalaeli, mbwaga ana, ‘Nkati jino ibii hindu yeyapikiwi kutiniwa, ngamwiiwesi kukomana na abaja binu mbaka hindu heyi ibiya ibokiki kati jino!’ <verse eid="JOS 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 7:14" />Pulukela mwaboti mwihika palongi jangu, likabila ku likabila. Likabila leliihaguliwa na Bambu sapanga liijenda kulongi, mwiika lukolu ku lulukoo. Lukolu lolwiihaguliwa na Bambu Sapanga lwijenda palongi kilongu palongi jikilongu. Kikaja senakisagula kiihegalia palongi mundu jumu jumu. <verse eid="JOS 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 7:15" />Mundu jokapi jobanketania na hindu yeabei palongi jaka Sapanga ankoma nu kuntini pa mwotu, jombi pamu na kila na hindu yejubii naku ndaba jusindiki kupwata malaganu gangu nepani Bambu Sapanga nu juhengiki lijambu lihoni ku Aizalaeli.”<verse eid="JOS 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 7:16" />Enu, Joshua jwajumuka pulukela ngani, jwaaleta Aizalaeli boti palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga likabila ku likabila, likabila laka Yuda batenda kulisagu. <verse eid="JOS 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 7:17" />Likabila laka Yuda jilileta palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga lukolu ku lukolu, nu lukolu lwaka Zelahi lwatenda kuluhagu. Kikaja ku kikaja ni kikaja simu saka Zabudi batenda kukihagu. <verse eid="JOS 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 7:18" />Ndienu, Joshua jwiileta ikaja yaka Zabudi palongi jaka Sapanga mundu jumu jumu na Akani mwana waka Kalimi jojabii nsokoo waka Zabudi na mwana uka Zela wi likabila laka Yuda batenda kulihagu. <verse eid="JOS 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 7:19" />Joshua ampwagila Akani, “Gwamwanangu, gupega magoti nu kundumbali Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wa Aizalaeli, nndumbalia nu gumbwagila gaguhengiki gala na gwinhiya.” <verse eid="JOS 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 7:20" />Akani anzibua, “Hena sakaka hengiki mahakau palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wa Aizalaeli. Nahela ndi enahengiki, <verse eid="JOS 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 7:21" />enijibona ingobu jimu jaamboni kuhuma ku Babeli, madini ga feza gabia kilu ibeli ni kidogu nu nndaba gwa zahabu gwabia nusu kilu, natokuliya nu kujukuu, nahembi pai mu lihema lango nu kuhiya madini ga feza gabia pai ja hindu yeheyi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Shekeli ndi kipemu seapemila Aebulania.</char></note><verse eid="JOS 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 7:22" />Enu, Joshua jwaatuma bandu bala, nabombi bajenda ku lihema laka Akani. Kumbi jwabiya juhiiki mu lihema laki nu madini ga feza gabii pai jaki. <verse eid="JOS 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 7:23" />Biijukua hindu yela kuhuma mu lihema nu kuipeleka kwaka Joshua na bandu boti Aizalaeli, biitanda pai, palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="JOS 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 7:24" />Ndienu, Joshua pamu na Aizalaeli boti, bunzukua Akani mwana waka Zela bumpelika ku ligomba la mang'aliku, bunzukua pamu na madini ga feza gala na ingobu na zahabu na bana baki akanalomi na bana baki akambomba na ng'ombi yaki na maponda na makondoo gaki ni lihema laki na kila sindu sejabii nasu. <verse eid="JOS 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 7:25" />Joshua anndalukia Akani, “Boo, ndaba jakike gutuleti mang'aliko? Bambu Sapanga jwaguletila mang'aliku lelenu gwamwete.” Aizalaeli boti bundapula Akani ku malibu mbaka kuwa. Ndienu biilapula kwa malibu kikaja saki soti mbaka kuwa na kwaajosa mwotu. <verse eid="JOS 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 7:26" />Ndienu balundika malibu gingipi panani jaki lilundu la malibu gehaga gabi mbaka lelenu na pandu je hapa bapakema ligomba la mang'aliku mbaka lelenu, ndienu inyela jaka Bambu Sapanga jatenda kutulia.<verse eid="JOS 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOS 8" />
  <para style="s">Musi wa Ai atenda kugukamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 8:1" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Joshua, “Gwijogopa, wala wiihola, gwaajukua bakomana ngondu baku boti nzendania nabu bukulapula musi gwa Ai, ndaba bambu nkolongu juku Ai numbei mu maboku gaku pamu na bandu baki na musi gwaki ni mipaka jaki. <verse eid="JOS 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 8:2" />Mwaguhalabana musi wa Ai pamu na bambu nkolongu waki ngati emuguhalabana musi wa Yeliku pamu na bambu nkolongu waki. Mali gaki ni mipugu jemwajikamula jibia mali gino. Nnzenda mukugulapula musi kuhumi upandi gumunyuma.”<verse eid="JOS 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 8:3" />Enu, Joshua jwaboka pamu na baakomana ngondu baki boti kujenda kugusambuli musi uku Ai. Jwahagula baakomana ngondu baabii na makili elupu selasini na kwaatuma ikilu. <verse eid="JOS 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 8:4" />Joshua jwaapwagila ana, “Nzoanya sapi, mmbanganya mwagujobalia musi kuhumi upandi guku nyuma. Mwiijenda kutali na musi, ila mwiibia mwijiandi kukomana kipindi soti. <verse eid="JOS 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 8:5" />Nepani, pamu na baakomana ngondu, twaguhegalia musi. Ebipita kunza bandu kuhika kukomana na twepani ngati ebatenda pu utumbuli, twepani twiitenda kwaatila. <verse eid="JOS 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 8:6" />Nabombi biendalia kutubengana mbaka pabibiya kutali na musi gwabu, ndaba biholalia butubengini ngati ebutubenga pu utumbuli. Twepani twaaleka butubengana. <verse eid="JOS 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 8:7" />Ndenu, mmbanganya mwipitila kuhumi hoku komwajobiki nu kugukamu musi, ndaba Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wino, ampekia mbanganya musi hogu. <verse eid="JOS 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 8:8" />Emwagukamula musi mwagujosa mwotu, mwiihenga ngati Bambu Sapanga eandagalakia. Haga ndi malagalaki ginu gamwiipwata.” <verse eid="JOS 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 8:9" />Enu, Joshua jwaatuma ajenda pandu pukujobale, na bombi batama upandi wa kolijingi lyoba wa musi uku Ai pikilanda ja musi wa Ai na Beteli. Lakini Joshua ikilu jela jwagoni ku likambi la Aizalaeli.<verse eid="JOS 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 8:10" />Joshua jwajumuka pulukela ngani, jombi na aseja buku Izilaeli baalonguliya bandu kujenda ku Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 8:11" />Baakomana ngondu boti bajalongana nabu bahika pambipi na musi we hogu nukutama upandi uku kazikazini, papuje labii ligomba pikilanda musi wa Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 8:12" />Ndienu jabia jwaajukwi akomana ngondu ngati elufu nhwanu elahe, nakwaabeka ajoba pikilanda ja musi wa Beteli na Ai, upandi golijingi lyoba wa musi wa Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 8:13" />Nsambi nkolongu gwa baakomana ngondu wabia ujiandi kukomana ngondu upandi wa kazikazini ja musi na babahigalia babeka upandi golijingi lyoba gwa musi. Lakini ikilu heji Joshua jwagonila kuligomba.<verse eid="JOS 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 8:14" />Bambu nkolongu wa musi gwa Ai ejabona hela, jombi na bandu boti ba musi hogu bajenda nyata pulukela namangani, ili kuketangana na Aizilaeli kukomana nabu pandu puhele ukujenda ku ligomba la losi luku Yoludani. Lakini ngase jamanyiki musi waki agujobali kuhuma kunyuma. <verse eid="JOS 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 8:15" />Ndienu, Joshua pamu na bandu bajabi naku bilihenga ngati atenda kusindwa, batumbuliya kulihenga ngati atila kukelabuka munyuma palongi jabu kujenda kulungwenza. <verse eid="JOS 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 8:16" />Akomana ngondu boti baatama mmusi uku Ai bakemana pamu kwapwata Aizalaeli na pababia ampwatali Joshua bajenda nukuleka musi wabu kutali. <verse eid="JOS 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 8:17" />Nga mundu jokapi jojwahigali mmusi gwa Ai wala ku Beteli jwanga kwaapwata Aizalaeli. Ndienu buguleka musi wabu nntopu na kwaapwata Aizilaeli.<verse eid="JOS 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 8:18" />Ndi Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Joshua, “Tondabiya nkoa waku gogubii mu kuboku jaku langia kumusi wa Ai ndaba musi hogu isinugubeka mu maboku gaku.” Joshua jwalangia nkoha waki mmusi wa Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 8:19" />Joshua ejalangia pe nkoha gwaki kumusi gwa Ai kola, nsambi wa bandu gogwajobali upandi golijingi lyoba gwapita nukujingi mmusi, bugukamula musi nukujosa mwotu. <verse eid="JOS 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 8:20" />Ndienu, akomana ngondu buku Ai ebalinga munyuma, babona lihoi kuhuma kumusi likwela mbaka kunani. Nabombi ngase babi nu uwesu gukutila kujenda upandi gwokape, Aizalaeli bababia atili ku lungwenza baang'anambuki nakwaabenga babia atenda kwaabenga bala. <verse eid="JOS 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 8:21" />Joshua na Aizalaeli boti ebabona nsambi wa bandu gogwajobalia gugukamwi musi, ni lihoi likwela kunani, akomana ngondu baang'anambukia nu kutumbuli kwaasambuli bandu buku Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 8:22" />Aizilaeli babahigali ku musi batenda kupita, lakini bandu boti buku Ai babiya ayongulitiwi na Aizalaeli na bombi batenda kwaakoma, ngajojwahigalile, <verse eid="JOS 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 8:23" />ila pe bambu nkolongu jwa musi wa Ai ankamula koni jubi mwomi nukupeleka kwaka Joshua.<verse eid="JOS 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 8:24" />Aizalaeli pabajomula kwaakoma bandu boti ba musi gwa Ai bababii kulungwenza kobabia baabenga, bakelubuka ku musi wa Ai na kwaakoma bandu boti babahigali homu. <verse eid="JOS 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 8:25" />Bandu boti babaakomiki mu lisoba heli, akanalomi na akambomba babia ngati elufu komi na abeli elehe. <verse eid="JOS 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 8:26" />Joshua ngase jwaahulwi kuboku kwaki kojabi jukamwi nkoha kulangi ku musi wa Ai mbaka pajaakoma bandu boti ba musi wa Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 8:27" />Aizalaeli biikamula inyama yu kupugwa na mali pe ngati Bambu Sapanga eandagalakia Joshua. <verse eid="JOS 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 8:28" />Enu, Joshua jugutinia musi gwa Ai kwa mwotu nu kuguhenga gubia ling'oba mbaka lelenu. <verse eid="JOS 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 8:29" />Ndienu bambu nkolongu juku Ai buntonga nkoa nukugujemeka mbaka pakamii. Lakini lyoba elatumbulia kujingi, Joshua jwalagalakiya aguhulua ntuhi kuhuma mu nkongu nu kuguleke pi litanga la musi ndi alundika lilundu likolongu la malibu panani ju ntui we hogu, lilundu le heli libii mbaka lelenu.<verse eid="JOS 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joshua jaakomboke bandu lilaganu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 8:30" />Ndienu, Joshua ansengila mesa jukupiki matambiku Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Aizalaeli mu kitombi sa Ebali. <verse eid="JOS 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 8:31" />Musa ntumisi guka Bambu Sapanga ngati ejwalagalakia Aizalaeli. Joshua jasenga sukupwata ngati eaandiki mwikitabu sa malagalaki gaka Musa kubanga Mesa jukupiki matambiku asenga sukutumi malibu ganga kuhongo, wala kuguswa sindu sokapi si kisoma soma. Panani ja mesa jukupikii matambiku heji ampikia Bambu Sapanga matambiku gu kutinii ni litambiku lukutama ku lukwali. <verse eid="JOS 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 8:32" />Na hoku, koni Aizilaeli boti atenda kunndingali, Joshua jwaandika malagalaki gaka Musa panani ja malibu. <verse eid="JOS 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 8:33" />Aizalaeli boti pamu na akakilongosi babu, aseja na batemu na ageni boti bababi pikilanda jabu, bajema kila upandi pambipi ni Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga palongi jaka agolu Alawi bababia atotwi Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga. Bangi bajema kwi kitombi sa Gelizimu na bangi kabee bajema kwi kitombi sa Ebali, ngati Musa ntumisi jwaka Bambu Sapanga, ejalagalakia pu utumbuli namuna Aizilaeli ebipengaliwa. <verse eid="JOS 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 8:34" />Ndienu, Joshua jwaasomila malagalaki goti, kupengalewa na yaambamba ngati eiandikwi mu kitabu sa malagalaki. <verse eid="JOS 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 8:35" />Ngase labii lilobi lejaalagalakia Musa lelule Joshua ngase julisomike palongi ja Aizalaeli, koni abii akambomba na bana na ageni baatamika pamu nabu.<verse eid="JOS 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOS 9" />
  <para style="s">Agibioni ankonga isoli Joshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 9:1" />Kuwesa kwa Aizilaeli kwamanyikana na akabambu boti bu upandi golijingi lyoba kwii ja losi lwa Yoludani. Akabambu haba atamika mwiitombi nu mu tutombi nu mu ubamba pambipi nu nhanga nkolongu nuku Lebanoni upandi uku Kasikazini. Akabambu haba babia Ahiti na Aamoli na Akanaani na Apelizi na Ahivi na Ayebusi, <verse eid="JOS 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 9:2" />baketangana na babiya sindi simu ili kukomana ngondu na Joshua na Aizalaeli.<verse eid="JOS 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 9:3" />Lakini bandu buku Gibeoni bababii Ahivi, ebajogwana namuna Joshua ejijihengi misi ja Yeliku na Ai, <verse eid="JOS 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 9:4" />baamua kunkonga isoli Joshua. Bakopakiya ngati atenga, baandia posu, bakwea maguni gagalai panani ja maponda gabu ni mipuku ja ngosi jejilai nu kusonwa, <verse eid="JOS 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 9:5" />bawata ilatu ni ingobu yeilai na posu yabu yoti yabi ijomu na yaimeliki kikongu. <verse eid="JOS 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 9:6" />Enu anzendila Joshua ku makambi ku Giligali, ampwagila jwombi na Aizalaeli, “Twepani tuhumiki nndema gu kutali, mpepa koku tuguloba guhenga lilaganu na twepani.”<verse eid="JOS 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 9:7" />Lakini Aizalaeli bajibua Ahivi haba ana, “Tuwesa boo kuhenga lilaganu na mwanganya? Pengi mwanganya nntama pambipi na twepani.” <verse eid="JOS 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 9:8" />Nabombi bumpwagila Joshua, “Twepani twa atumisi baku.” Najombi Joshua jwaalalukia, “Boo, mwanganya mwaka nyane nu unhumi kwako?” <verse eid="JOS 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 9:9" />Anzibua, “Twepani twaatumisi baku tujetaki wehapa utulongua, tuhumiki nndema gu kutali na tuhikiki ndaba tujogwini majambu gaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wino, twajogwana majambu gu ukolongu gwaki na goti gajahengiki ku nndema wa Misili. <verse eid="JOS 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 9:10" />Twajogwana goti gajaahengi akabambu abeli ba Aamoli bababi upandi golipiti lyoba kwii ja losi lwa Yoludani. Akabambu be haba babiya bambu nkolongu juku Sihoni gwa Heshiboni na bambu nkolongu juku Ogu juku Bashani jojwalongua nndema wa Ashitaloti. <verse eid="JOS 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 9:11" />Ndienu, aseja bitu na bandu boti bunndema gwitu, butupwagila, tujukua posu ju nsapwali, tuhika kuketangana na mwanganya nu kumpwagi kubanga twepani ndi twa atumisi binu, mpepa koku nnhenga lilaganu na twepani. <verse eid="JOS 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 9:12" />Linga mabumunda gitu egabia ga mwotu patwatumbulia kutoto kipindi patwabokania kunyumba, lakini sajenu gajomiki mbaka gakamwi kikongu. <verse eid="JOS 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 9:13" />Mipuku ja ngosi jitu jenze tujitwelaki divai koni jibii inyai, lakini sajenu jijwendukini. Hata ingobu ni sambali hitu ijendwikini, ndaba tuhumiki kutali nakanopi.”<verse eid="JOS 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 9:14" />Ndienu, Aizalaeli bajukua posu yabu sanga kunndaluki Bambu Sapanga sukuhenga. <verse eid="JOS 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 9:15" />Joshua jwajongana nabu kutama su lukwali, jwahenga lilaganu kubanga jwajetakale kutama. Akikilongosi ba bandu Aizalaeli baalapila ngati ebajongana nabu.<verse eid="JOS 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 9:16" />Egapeta masoba matatu ebabiya ahengiki lilaganu heli, Aizalaeli bamanya kubanga bandu haba babia atamani pambipi pikilanda jabu. <verse eid="JOS 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 9:17" />Enu, Aizalaeli batumbuliya sapwali ni lisoba la tatu bahika mu misi ja bandu bala. Misi jeheji ndi jabia Gibeoni na Kefila na Beeloti na Kiliati Yealimu. <verse eid="JOS 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 9:18" />Lakini Aizalaeli ngase baakomiki, ndaba aka kilongosi ba Aizalaeli babiya baalapi kubanga nga baakomi kwi lihina laka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wa Aizalaeli. Enu bandu boti bayomila aka kilongosi babu. <verse eid="JOS 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 9:19" />Lakini aka kilongosi ba Aizalaeli baapwagila bandu haba, “Ndaba tundapi yaambamba kwi lihina laka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wa Aizalaeli, enu ngatuwesi kunhumisa. <verse eid="JOS 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 9:20" />Tundeka ntama, ili twiipata inyela yaka Sapanga jatukelabuki twepani ndaba twibiya tusindwiki kupwata kulapa kotwalapaninya. <verse eid="JOS 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 9:21" />Mwaaleki atama ili abia atutinyi hanzu nu kututeke masi.” Hela ndi akikilongosi ba Aizalaeli ebapwagila.<verse eid="JOS 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 9:22" />Ndienu, Joshua jwaakema Agibeoni na kwaalaluki, “Boo, ndaba jakike kutukonga unhuma kunndema gu kutali nakati mbanganya ntama pambipi na twenga? <verse eid="JOS 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 9:23" />Henu, mbanganya mpatiki yaambamba na masoba goti mwiibiya mwatumwa bitu nukutinya hanzu nu kuteka masi kwa ndaba ja nyumba jaka Sapanga wangu.”<verse eid="JOS 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 9:24" />Anzibua Joshua, “Butupwagila kubanga sakaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wino, andagalakia ntumisi waki Musa jaakoma bandu boti bunndema gongo nukumpekee mbanganya nndema gongo kuba mali gino. Enu twajogupa kutukoma ndi mana twahenga lijambu heli. <verse eid="JOS 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 9:25" />Enu twepani tubii mu ulongosi waku, gutuhengila sokapi segukibona sa amboni.” <verse eid="JOS 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 9:26" />Enu, Joshua jaalenda Agibeoni kuhuma mu maboku ga Aizalaeli ili baakoma. <verse eid="JOS 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 9:27" />Lakini tumbuka lisoba lela, Joshua jwaapekiya bandu haba lihengu la kwaatinyi nhanzu nu kwaateke masi Aizalaeli boti na kwa ndaba mesa jukupiki matambiku jaka Bambu Sapanga, pandu pokapi pala Bambu Sapanga pajuhagula mbaka lelenu.<verse eid="JOS 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOS 10" />
  <para style="s">Aamoli atei kusindwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 10:1" />Adoni Sedeki bambu nkolongu juku Yelusalemu jajoana majambu namuna Joshua ejugukamula musi gwa Ai nu kugukoma tipitipi. Ngati ejuguhenga mu musi wa Yeliku na bambu waki. Kabee jajoana majambu kubanga, bandu buku Gibeoni ebabiya alenganiki lukwali na Aizalaeli batamani naku pamu nabu. <verse eid="JOS 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 10:2" />Majambu gehaga galeta lujogopu lukolongu ku Yelusalemu ndaba musi guku Gibeoni wabi maalupu kati ja misi jejabi na aka bambu. Musi hogu wabi nkolongu kupeta musi uku Ai na akanalomi boti babii nu uwesu ukukomana sapi na bababii akalonda bana makili ngani. <verse eid="JOS 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 10:3" />Ndienu, Adoni Sedeki bambu nkolongu juku Yelusalemu jwaapelika malobi gaka bambu nkolongu Hohamu juku Hebuloni, Pilamu bambu nkolongu juku Yamute, Yafia bambu nkolongu juku Lakishi, Debili bambu nkolongu juku Eguloni, jwaapwagila, <verse eid="JOS 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 10:4" />“Unhikaniya unyangatia kwa koma Agibeoni, ndaba ahengiki lilaganu lukutama ku lukwali na Joshua na Aizalaeli.” <verse eid="JOS 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 10:5" />Ndipala Akabambu nhanu buku Aamoli baunganisa akalonda babu, babeka kambi kuguyongalota musi hogu na kwaasambuli, akabambu behaba babiya ndi bambu nkolongu juku Yelusalemu na bambu nkolongu juku Hebuloni na bambu nkolongu juku Yalimuti na bambu nkolongu juku Lakishi na bambu nkolongu juku Eguloni,<verse eid="JOS 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 10:6" />Agibeoni bapelika malobi kwaka Joshua ku Giligali kojabei kambi, ampwagila, “Gupepa koku Joshua, watuleka twepani twa atumisi baku, guhika kanyata gutujangatia nukutuoko ndaba aka bambu boti ba Aamoli kuhuma mu milema ji itombi aungini pamu na kuhika kutusambuli.”<verse eid="JOS 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 10:7" />Ndienu, Joshua pamu na aka alonda baki boti baawesa kukomana sapi baboka ku Giligali. <verse eid="JOS 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 10:8" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Joshua, “Gwajogopa hata kulenga ndaba naabei pai ju ulongosi waku, nga jikubi hata jumu jojiwesa kokomana na wehapa.”<verse eid="JOS 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 10:9" />Joshua jajenda kelukelu kuhuma ku Giligali na jaasambuliya su kujituki.<verse eid="JOS 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 10:10" />Bambu Sapanga jwaajegala lujogopu lukolongu palongi ja Aizalaeli na bombi Aizilaeli baakoma Aamoli bingi ku Gibeoni na kwaabenga, na batilila kujenda kwi indela ju uheleu wa Beti Holoni mbaka ku Azeka na Makeda kokuje kabee baakomiki bandu bingi ngani. <verse eid="JOS 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 10:11" />Pababiya baatila, Aizalaeli puheleu gwa Beti Holoni, Bambu Sapanga jwaleta iyula ngolongu ji indobi kuhuma kunani pababiya mwiindela mbaka ku Ezeka, enu bandu babakuwa kwi iyula ji indobi baabia bingi kupeta babakuwa kwa silaa ya Aizalaeli.<verse eid="JOS 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 10:12" />Lisoba heli, Bambu Sapanga pajwabeka Aamoli mumaboku ga Aizalaeli, Joshua andoba Bambu Sapanga palongi jaka Aizalaeli boti, jwapwaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOS 10:12">“Gwa lyoba latenda kujema, panani ja musi gwa Gibeoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:12">na gwa Mwei gujema mu ligomba la Aiyaloni.”<verse eid="JOS 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 10:13" />Lyoba latenda kujema na mwei gwa jemaa mbaka bandu buku Izalaeli pabalepisa kisasi sabu kwaka abaja babu. Ngati eandiki mwikitabu saka Yashali. Lyoba lajema nuu pikilanda kunani, na laselawa kujingi ku lisoba limu. <verse eid="JOS 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 10:14" />Lisoba ngati ale ngaseliwaiki kupiti na ngalipiti kabete, lisoba lelule Bambu Sapanga anzoaninya mundu kwa namuna jela, ndaba Bambu Sapanga mweni ndi jwaakomania Aizalaeli.<verse eid="JOS 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 10:15" />Ndienu, Joshua jwakelubuka ku kambi jaki ku Giligali pamu naka Aizalaeli boti.<verse eid="JOS 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joshua jwaakoma aka bambu akolongu nhwanu buku Aamoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 10:16" />Akabambu akolongu nhwanu bala batila nu kujenda kujoba mwi likolu luku Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 10:17" />Joshua jajoana majambu kubanga aka bambu akolongu nhwanu ajobiki mu likolu luku Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 10:18" />Joshua jwalagalakia, “Uhingalitia malibu makolongu mundyangu mu likolu na mwaabeka alonda bu kulilonda. <verse eid="JOS 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 10:19" />Lakini mwanganya mwiitama hoku, ila mwapwata akabaja bino. Mkalimanga kuhumi munyuma, wala mwaaleka kujingi mu misi jabu, ndaba Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wii junhengiki nhwesa.” <verse eid="JOS 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 10:20" />Joshua pamu na Aizalaeli jwaalimanga nu kwaakoma boti, na asokopi babahigali batilila mu misi jabu jeayongalaki lumatu. <verse eid="JOS 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 10:21" />Henu alonda boti bakelubuka sapi kwaka Joshua ku likambi ku Makeda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 10:21">Nga mundu kabee jokapi jojawesa kulonge sokapi kupete Aizalaeli.<verse eid="JOS 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 10:22" />Ndienu Joshua jwaapwaga, “Mmboa malibu mu ndyangu gwi likolu nnetila aka bambu akolongu nhwanu haba.” <verse eid="JOS 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 10:23" />Nabombi batenda hela, andetila Joshua aka bambu nhwanu behaba ndi, bambu nkolongu juku Yelusalemu na bambu nkolongu juku Hebuloni na bambu nkolongu juku Yalimuti na bambu nkolongu juku Lakishi na bambu nkolongu juku Eguloni. <verse eid="JOS 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 10:24" />Akabambu akolongu haba pabaaleta, Joshua jwaakema Aizalaeli boti na akolongu baka akalonda bajapiti nabu ku ngondu, jwapwagila, “Uhegalia pambipi mwaakanyatia nhingu ya aka bambu akolongu haba.” Nabombi bahegalia na kwaakanyati nhingu. <verse eid="JOS 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 10:25" />Joshua jwaapwagila “Mwijogopa, wala mwikuwa mwoju, mmbiya nganganganga na mwijogopa hata kidogu, ndaba hela ndi Bambu Sapanga ejwaahengila abaja binu boti pamwiikomana naku.” <verse eid="JOS 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 10:26" />Ndienu, Joshua jwaakoma su kwatonga mu mikongu nhwanu kila bambu mu nkongu waki ni mitui jabu jajenzala mbaka pakamii. <verse eid="JOS 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 10:27" />Lyoba elabiya pambipi kujingi, Joshua jwalagalakia mitui jela ahulua kuhuma mu mikongu na alekala mu nndyangu ji likolu lebabiya ajobiki. Ndienu babeka malibu makolongu pu ndwangu gwi likolu nu malibu haga gabi hoku mbaka lelelu.<verse eid="JOS 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joshua jujikamu misi jengi ja Aamoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 10:28" />Lisoba heli, Joshua jugukamula musi guku Makeda, ankoma bambu nkolongu waki su upanga na bandu baki boti sanga kunndeka hata jumu. Ahengila bambu nkolongu juku Makeda ngati eanhengila bambu nkolongu juku Yeliku.<verse eid="JOS 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 10:29" />Pabahuma ku musi wa Makeda, Joshua pamu na Aizalaeli boti bajenda ku musi gwa Libina nu kugusambuli. <verse eid="JOS 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 10:30" />Bambu Sapanga jukubeka musi hogu pamu na bambu nkolongu waki mu maboku ja Aizalaeli. Joshua jaakoma bandu ba musi gola sanga kuhigaki hata jumu. Buhengila bambu nkolongu juku Libina ngati ebunhengila bambu nkolongu juku Yeliku.<verse eid="JOS 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 10:31" />Ndienu, pabahuma ku musi wa Libina, Joshua pamu na Aizalaeli boti bajenda ku musi gwa Lakishi nu kugusambuli. <verse eid="JOS 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 10:32" />Bambu Sapanga jaahenga Aizalaeli buguwesa musi gola na Joshua jugukamu lisoba la pili. Jaakoma bandu boti ba musi hogu ngati ejahenga ku musi uku Libina.<verse eid="JOS 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 10:33" />Enu, Bambu nkolongu Holamu jwa musi wa Gezeli jwahika kwaajangati bandu ba musi wa Lakishi. Lakini Joshua jaawesa jombi na bandu baki boti, ngase jwahigali hata jumu.<verse eid="JOS 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 10:34" />Ndienu, Joshua na Aizilaeli boti pabahuma ku musi wa Lakishi, bajenda mbaka ku musi uku Eguloni buguyonguluta nu kugusambuli. <verse eid="JOS 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 10:35" />Bugukamula lisoba alelale na kwaakoma bandu baki boti ku upanga ngati ebahenga ku musi wa Lakishi.<verse eid="JOS 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 10:36" />Ndienu pabahuma kumusi wa Eguloni Joshua na Aizalaeli boti bajenda mbaka musi wa Hebuloni nu kugusambuli, <verse eid="JOS 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 10:37" />nu kugukamu. Baakoma bandu boti pamu na bambu nkolongu wabu, bijihalabana nakanopi misi joti jejibii pambipi, baakoma bandu babu boti ngati ebahenga ku musi wa Eguloni.<verse eid="JOS 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 10:38" />Ndienu, Joshua na Aizalaeli boti bakelubuka ku musi wa Debili nu kugusambuli. <verse eid="JOS 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 10:39" />Bugukamula musi gola na bambu nkolongu wabu pamu na misi jengi joti jejabi pambipi naku, na kwaakoma bandu boti sanga kunhigaki hata jumu. Buguhengila musi hogu ngati ebuguhengila musi wa Hebuloni na musi wa Libina na aka bambu akolongu babu.<verse eid="JOS 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 10:40" />Enu, Joshua jugukamula nndema gwoti, jwaawesa aka bambu akolongu ba pandu pi itombi nu tutombi na pandu pi lieneu lijomu lu upandi u kusini, na pandu pu ubamba ni ihele. Ngase jikilei sokapi sekibi somi jwaakoma kila sindu ngati Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wa Aizilaeli, eanndagalakia. <verse eid="JOS 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 10:41" />Joshua jaalapula bandu boti kuhuma ku musi wa Kadeshi Balinea mbaka ku musi wa Gaza, nu kuhuma ku musi wa Gosheni mbaka musi wa Gibeoni. <verse eid="JOS 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 10:42" />Jawesa kugukamu nndema hogu gwoti pamu na aka bambu akolongu baki ndaba Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Izilaeli jwabia jwaajangatiya Aizilaeli. <verse eid="JOS 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 10:43" />Ndienu, Joshua jwakelubuka pamu na Aizilaeli boti mbaka kobabiya abei likambi ku Giligali.<verse eid="JOS 10:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOS 11" />
  <para style="s">Joshua anhwesa Jabini na aka bambu akolongu bangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 11:1" />Bambu nkolongu Jabini jwa musi gwa Hazoli ejapata majambu gukuwesa kwaka Joshua, jwaatuma bandu kulonge na aka bambu akolongu baabi pambipi najombi kwaaloba ajongana naku kukomana na Aizilaeli. Jwaatuma bandu haba kuku bambu nkolongu Jobabu jwa Madoni na bambu nkolongu juku Simuloni na bambu nkolongu juku Akishafi, <verse eid="JOS 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 11:2" />Jwaatuma bandu kulonge na bambu nkolongu wa bandu bababi atama mwitombi yu upandi uku kazikazini, bababii ku ligomba luku losi luku Yoludani upandi uku kusini uku Galilaya lelibii ku ubamba ni ligomba lelibii ku Nafati Doli jejibi upandi golijingi lyoba. <verse eid="JOS 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 11:3" />Kabee, jaatuma bandu kulonge na Akaanani bababia atama upandi golipitii lyoba nu upandi golijingi lyoba kwaka Aamoli na Ahiti na Apelizi na Ayebusi bababia atama kwiitombi na Ahivi bababia atama pai ji kitombi sa Helumoni ku nndema wa Misipa. <verse eid="JOS 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 11:4" />Enu, bapita boti na alonda babu boti. Nabombi babi bingi ngati nsangi guku mbwani bahika na magali gingi gaalenganaki na somasoma gagahutwa ni inyama yebikema falasi. <verse eid="JOS 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 11:5" />Akabambu akolongu boti haba bajongana nukubeka makambi gabu pi kiliba sa Melomu ili akomana na Aizalaeli.<verse eid="JOS 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 11:6" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Joshua, “Gwaajogopa haba, ndaba kilabu kipindi ngati senze, naakoma boti nakwaahenga Aizilaeli baawesa, numbanganya mwisekulana mitaanda ja falasi yabu nu kugatinii magali gabu kwa mwotu.” <verse eid="JOS 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 11:7" />Enu, Joshua na akomana ngondu baki boti, bajenda kwasambuli sakwaajituki mu masi guku Melomu. <verse eid="JOS 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 11:8" />Bambu Sapanga jwaahenga Aizilaeli baawesa, nabombi baalimanga na kwaabenga mbaka ku Sidoni musi nkolongu na ku Miselefoti Maimu, mbaka kuhiki pi ligomba lu upandi golipita lyoba ku Mizipa na nga mundu jobunndeka mwomi. Aizalaeli baalimanga na kwaakoma boti. <verse eid="JOS 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 11:9" />Joshua jwaahengila ngati Bambu Sapanga heanndagalakia. Jwasekulana mitanda yii inyama yabu yebiikema falasi yabu yoti nu kutinii kwa mwotu magali gabu goti gukukomane gagahutwa na falasi ngati he bunndagalaki.<verse eid="JOS 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 11:10" />Joshua pajwabia jutenda kubuja, jugukamula musi wa Azoli. Ndaba musi wa Azoli pamwandi wakabii musi nkolongu wa aka bambu akolongu boti. <verse eid="JOS 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 11:11" />Ndienu jaakoma bandu boti babii mu musi hogu ngaseandei hata jumu mwomi, nukugutini musi wa Azoli hogu kwa mwotu. <verse eid="JOS 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 11:12" />Kabee jijikamula misi jela joti sukujilapu ku upanga na kwaakoma aka bambu akolongu babu boti ngati eandagalakia Musa, ntumisi waka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="JOS 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 11:13" />Lakini Aizalaeli ngasebijitinii misi jejabi kwiitombi, ilape musi gwa Azoli ambagu Joshua jugutinia. <verse eid="JOS 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 11:14" />Aizalaeli batola hindu yoti yebiikamwi ni inyama yeyabii mu misi heji, lakini baakoma bandu baki boti bababii homu ngasebunndei mundu jokapi jubia mwomi. <verse eid="JOS 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 11:15" />Ngati Bambu Sapanga eanndagalakiya Musa ntumisi waki, najombi Musa andagalakia Joshua kubanga jugahenga. Joshua jwaahenga kila sindu ngati Bambu Sapanga eandagalakia Musa.<verse eid="JOS 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milema jejijikamula Joshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 11:16" />Joshua jugukamula nndema gwoti. Nnndema woti wiitombi na nndema woti wiitombi isokuisoku upandi uku kasikazini nu kusini, nndema woti wa Gosheni nu nndema nnzomu gogubii upandi uku kusini pamu ni ligomba la losi lwa Yoludani. <verse eid="JOS 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 11:17" />Kuhuma ku kitombi sa Halaki kujenda Seili mbaka Baali Gadi ku ligomba la Lebanoni, kusini ji kitombi sa Helumoni, jaakamula aka abambu akolongu jaalapula na kwaakoma. <verse eid="JOS 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 11:18" />Joshua jakomana na aka bambu akolongu haba boti kwa masoba gingipi. <verse eid="JOS 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 11:19" />Nga musi gogwajetanganinya kutama ku lukwali na Aizalaeli, ila pe Ahivi baatama ku Gibioni. Aizalaeli bijikamula misi jengi joti sukukomana ngondu. <verse eid="JOS 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 11:20" />Bambu Sapanga mweni ndi jojahenga abiya ni ing'omu na akomana na Aizilaeli. Jwapala baabonila ikia ila baakoma. Hela ndi Bambu Sapanga eandagalakia Musa.<verse eid="JOS 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 11:21" />Masoba haga, Joshua jwajenda kwaakoma Aanaki bababiya atama mwi itombi ku Hebuloni nu ku Debili nuku Anabu kuhuma mu nndema gwoti gwi itombi yaka Yuda nuku nndema woti uku Izilaeli. Joshua jaakoma bandu haba pamu na misi jabu. <verse eid="JOS 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 11:22" />Nga mundu jwi likabila la Anaki baatamika mu nndema wa Aizalaeli jojahigali, bahigalia asokopi pena ku nndema uku Gaza nuku Gati nuku Ashidodi.<verse eid="JOS 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 11:23" />Enu, Joshua jugukamula nndema gwoti kulengana na Bambu Sapanga eandangalakia Musa. Joshua jwaapekia nndema hogu Aizalaeli gubia mali gabu, ndienu jaabaganakiya nndema hogu kwa kila likabila labu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 11:23">Ndienu nndema gwoti gwatenda kutulia na ngase kwabia na ngondu kabete.<verse eid="JOS 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOS 12" />
  <para style="s">Aka bambu akolongu bajaawesa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 12:1" />Bamba ndi akabambu akolongu babube Aizalaeli baawesa nu kujuku nndema gwabu gwoti gogwabia upandi golipitii lyoba kwii ja losi lwa Yoludani, kuhuma ku ligomba la losi lwa Alinoni mbaka kitombi sa Helumoni nu nndema gwoti wiligomba la losi Yoludani upandi golipitii lyoba. <verse eid="JOS 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 12:2" />Bambu nkolongu Sihoni jwa Aamoli jwatama ku Heshiboni nu kulongosa kuhuma kunyuma jaki ju ubambu ku Aloeli, musi gogwabi pulutengu ji ligomba la Alinoni. Jwalongusa kabee kutumbuli pikilanda ji ligomba la Alinoni mbaka kulosi lwa Yaboki lolulwe lwabi mpaka gu nndema gwa Amoni, bambu nkolongu juku Sioni jalongusa nusu ju nndema gwa Gileadi. <verse eid="JOS 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 12:3" />Ahelahe kabee jwalongusa nndema gwoti guku ligomba la losi lwa Yoludani, kuhuma ku nhanga wa Kineleti upandi golipita lyoba, mbaka ku Beti Yeshimoti kunhanga gwa mwinyu nu kuendele mbaka pai ji kitombi sa Pisiga.<verse eid="JOS 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 12:4" />Kabee anndapula bambu nkolongu Ogu jumu jwa Alefai babahigali, jojwaalongusa ku Bashani na jutamika ku Ashitaloti nuku Edilei. <verse eid="JOS 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 12:5" />Najombi jalongusa kwi itombi ya Helumoni, ku musi uku Saleka, ku Bashani kwoti mbaka ku mipaka ja Ageshuli na Amaaka na nusu ja Agileadi mbaka mu mpaka gu nndema waka bambu nkolongu Sihoni jwa Heshiboni. <verse eid="JOS 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 12:6" />Musa ntumisi waka Bambu Sapanga, pamu na Aizalaeli baawesa akabambu akolongu haba. Musa jaapekia milema heji jibiya mali gabu bandu ba likabila laka Lubeni ni likabila laka Gadi na nusu ji likabila la Manase.<verse eid="JOS 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akabambu akolongu bajalapula Joshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 12:7" />Haba ndi akabambu akolongu bi milema bajalapula Joshua pamu na Aizalaeli bababi atama upandi golijingi lyoba ku losi lwa Yoludani. Kutumbuli ku Baali Gadi mu ligomba luku Lebanoni mbaka mwikitombi sa Alaki gowabii upandi u kusini pambipi na Seili. Joshua jaabaganakiya makabila ga Aizalaeli milema heji jibia mali gabu. <verse eid="JOS 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 12:8" />Milema ji itombi nu tutombi upandi wa golijingi lioba ni ligomba la losi Yoludani pamu ni iheleu na ji itombi na maeneu guku nndema nnzomu uku kusini nu lungwenza. Jenze ndi ndema jejabii atama Ahiti na Aamoli na Akanaani na Ahivi na Ayebusi. <verse eid="JOS 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 12:9" />Akabambu akolongu babalapulika na Aizalaeli babiya ndi bamba, bambu nkolongu juku Yeliku na bambu nkolongu juku Ai musi gogwabi pambipi na Beteli, <verse eid="JOS 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 12:10" />bambu nkolongu juku Yelusalemu na bambu nkolongu juku Hebuloni, <verse eid="JOS 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 12:11" />bambu nkolongu juku Yalimuti na bambu nkolongu juku Lakishi, <verse eid="JOS 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 12:12" />bambu nkolongu juku Eguloni na bambu nkolongu juku Gezeli, <verse eid="JOS 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 12:13" />bambu nkolongu juku Debili na bambu nkolongu juku Gedeli, <verse eid="JOS 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 12:14" />bambu nkolongu juku Holima na bambu nkolongu juku Aladi, <verse eid="JOS 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 12:15" />bambu nkolongu juku Libina na bambu nkolongu juku Adulamu, <verse eid="JOS 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 12:16" />bambu nkolongu juku Makeda na bambu nkolongu juku Beteli, <verse eid="JOS 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 12:17" />bambu nkolongu juku Tapua na bambu nkolongu juku Hefeli, <verse eid="JOS 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 12:18" />bambu nkolongu juku Afeka na bambu nkolongu juku Lashaloni, <verse eid="JOS 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 12:19" />bambu nkolongu juku Madoni na bambu nkolongu juku Hazoli, <verse eid="JOS 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 12:20" />bambu nkolongu juku Shimloni Meloni na bambu juku Akishapi, <verse eid="JOS 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 12:21" />bambu nkolongu juku Taanaki na bambu nkolongu juku Megido, <verse eid="JOS 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 12:22" />bambu nkolongu juku Kadeshi na bambu nkolongu juku Yokineamu jwa musi gogubi kwi kitombi sa Kalimeli, <verse eid="JOS 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 12:23" />bambu nkolongu juku Doli jwi lieneu la Nafati Doli, na bambu nkolongu Goiimu juku Giligali, <verse eid="JOS 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 12:24" />bambu nkolongu juku Tiliza. Aka bambu akolongu boti babiya ndi selasini na jimu.<verse eid="JOS 12:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOS 13" />
  <para style="s">Pandu puku kaanani panga kujukuliwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 13:1" />Joshua pajwabia nseja na yaka yaki yabia ipetiki ngani. Enu, Bambu Sapanga apwagila, “Weapa henu guseja na gubii na yaka hingi na jihigali milema jingi janga kujukuliwa pandu pakolongu punndema gwanga kujukuliwa. <verse eid="JOS 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 13:2" />Milema heji ndi nndema woti wa Apilisiti nu nndema woti wa Geshuli, <verse eid="JOS 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 13:3" />Pandu pa babia atama Akaanani, kutumbuli kalosi ka Shiholi upandi uku kusini mu mpaka uku Misili mbaka ku Ekuloni upandi uku kasikazini, milema je heji jamanyikana ja Akanani. Akabambu akolongu ba Apilisiti atamika ku Gaza nuku Ashidodi nuku Ashekeloni nuku Gati nuku Ekiloni mbaka nndema uku Avi. <verse eid="JOS 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 13:4" />Akaanani bangi babia bakona atama upandi gu kasikazini gogwabii wakona ngase bugujukwii. Kabee nndema ja Aakanaani kutumbuli ku Ala ja Asidoni mbaka ku Efeka mu mpaka wa Aamoli, <verse eid="JOS 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 13:5" />kabee nndema wa Gebali na Lebanoni upandi kolipita lyoba ku Baali Gadi pai jikitombi sa Helumoni mbaka ku Lebo Hamati, <verse eid="JOS 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 13:6" />kabee nndema ja bandu baatama ku itombi ya Lebanoni na Miselefoti Maimu ambaku bandu babu ndi Asidoni boti. Aizalaeli kadili mobaendilia kuhegale kulongi mwi milema heji, nepani namwe naabenga haba palongi jabu ja aizilaeli boti. Nagwe gwabagila bandu Aizalaeli milema heji jibia mali jabu ngati henugulagalaki. <verse eid="JOS 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 13:7" />Ndienu wagabagila makabila tisa milema heji na nusu jilikabila laka Manase nabombi nndema hogu gubia mali jabu.”<verse eid="JOS 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nndema gowabi upandi golipita lyoba ku Yoludani atenda kubagana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 13:8" />Makabila gaka Lubeni na Gadi na nusu jengi jilikabila laka Manase, bombi baapekia nndema go baapekiwi na Musa gogubii upandi golipitii lyoba losi lwa Yoludani ngati Bambu Sapanga eanndagalakia Musa ntumisi waki. <verse eid="JOS 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 13:9" />Nndema hogu watumbuliya ku Aloeli mu lutengu ju nkoka wa Alinoni na musi gola gowabii mu ligomba, nu nndema gu umbamba gola gwoti kutumbuli ku Medeba mbaka ku Diboni, <verse eid="JOS 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 13:10" />pamu na misi jaka bambu nkolongu Sihoni jwaka Aamoli, jojwalongusa ku Heshiboni mbaka mu mpaka wa Aamoni, <verse eid="JOS 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 13:11" />pamu ni milema ja Gileadi, nndema wa Ageshuli na Aamaakati, kitombi sa Helumoni nu nndema woti wa Bashani mbaka ku Seleka, <verse eid="JOS 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 13:12" />nu nndema woti gojulongusa bambu nkolongu jumu joankema Ogu jwa Aalefai babahigali, jojwaalongusa ku musi wa Ashitaloti na Edelei mu Bashani. Musa jwaawesa haba boti na akwabenge kutali. <verse eid="JOS 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 13:13" />Hata hela Aizilaeli ngasebaabengiki bandu buku Geshuli na Aamaaka henu aendale kutama pamu na Aizalaeli mbaka lelenu.<verse eid="JOS 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 13:14" />Musa ngase jwaapeki bandu bi likabila la Lawi nndema gwokapi jibiya mali gabu. Ila bombi bumpikia matambiku gukutini Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wa Aizilaeli, hogu ndi wabiya ulisi wabu, ngati Bambu Sapanga eandagalakia Musa.<verse eid="JOS 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pandu punndema pa bilipekia likabila la Lubeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 13:15" />Yenze ndi nndema papuje Musa jwaapekia bandu bi likabila laka Lubeni kulengana nu lukolu lwabu. <verse eid="JOS 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 13:16" />Nndema wabu watumbuliya ku Aloeli pulutengu ju nkoka uku Alinoni na musi wabu wabii pikilanda ji ligomba heli pamu nu nndema woti gu ubamba wa Medeba. <verse eid="JOS 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 13:17" />Jabia kabee pamu na Heshiboni na misi jaki joti jejabi pu ubamba. Musi wa Diboni na musi wa Bamoti Baali na musi wa Beti Baali Meoni, <verse eid="JOS 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 13:18" />na musi wa Yahasa na musi wa Kedemoti na musi wa Mefaati, <verse eid="JOS 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 13:19" />musi wa Kiliataimu na musi wa Sibuna na musi wa Seleti Shahali panani ji kitombi ku ligomba, <verse eid="JOS 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 13:20" />musi wa Beti Peoli na iheleu yi kitombi yuku Pisiga na Beti Yeshimoti, <verse eid="JOS 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 13:21" />na misi joti ju ubamba nu nndema woti waka bambu nkolongu Sihoni wa Aamoli jojwalongusa ku Heshiboni, Musa jwabiya andapwi bambu nkolongu Sihoni pamu na akabambu akolongu boti bu nndema uku Midiani nu nndema wa Avi nu nndema wa Lekemu na nu nndema wa Suli nu nndema uku Huli na nu nndema uku Leba babalongusa nndema kwa ndaba ja bambu nkolongu Sihoni. <verse eid="JOS 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 13:22" />Balaamu mwana waka Beoli jojabiya nnganga, jobunkoma Aizalaeli ikilu. <verse eid="JOS 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 13:23" />Mpaka gu nndema u likabila laka Lubeni wabii upandi wa kolijingi lyoba wabiya losi lwa Yoludani. Misi heji ni ijiji yaki ndi yebaapekiya bana baka Lubeni kulengana nu lukolu lwabu.<verse eid="JOS 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pandu pababagulia bandu bi likabila la Gadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 13:24" />Yenze ndi nndema yejwaapekiya Musa bandu bi likabila la Gadi kulengana nu lukolu lwabu. <verse eid="JOS 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 13:25" />Nndema wabu wapakini na Yazeli na misi joti ja Gileadi na nusu ju nndema wa Aamoli mbaka Aloeli gogwabi upandi wa kolipita lyoba ku Laba, <verse eid="JOS 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 13:26" />ahelahe kutumbuli ku musi wa Heshiboni mbaka ku musi wa Lamati Mizipe na ku musi wa Betonimu nu kuhuma ku musi wa Mahanaimu mbaka mu mpaka wa musi wa Lodebali. <verse eid="JOS 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 13:27" />Kabee misi jejabi mu ligomba la losi lwa Yoludani na musi wa Beti Halamu na musi wa Beti Nimula na musi wa Sukoti na musi wa Zafoni nu nndema woti gogwabi waka Bambu Sihoni jwa musi wa Heshiboni. Misi heji yabiya upandi golipita lyoba wa Yoludani na wapakana upandi ukusini na nhanga wa Kineleti. <verse eid="JOS 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 13:28" />Heji ndi misi ni ijiji yebapekiya bandu bi likabila la Gadi kulengana nu lukolu lwabu.<verse eid="JOS 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milema jebapekiya bandu bi likabila la Manase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 13:29" />Musa jwilipekia nusu ji likabila laka Manase kulengana nu lukolu lwabu milema jibiya mali gabu, <verse eid="JOS 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 13:30" />nndema wabu watumbuliya kuhuma Mahanaimu mbaka kujingi mu nndema woti gowabi guka bambu nkolongu Ogu jejabii mu nndema uku Bashani, pamu na misi sitini jaka Yaili, <verse eid="JOS 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 13:31" />nusu ja nndema wa Agileadi na Edelei, ambaju jabi pai jaka kilongosi Bambu nkolongu Ogu jwa musi gwa Bashani. Nndema hogu bumpekia nusu ji kibeleku saka Makili mwana waka Manase, kulengana nu lukolu lwabu.<verse eid="JOS 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 13:32" />Musa jwabia jwabaganasi nndema hogu gogwabi upandi golipita lyoba ja musi wa Yeliku na losi lwa Yoludani, kipindi sejabi pu ubamba wa Moabu. <verse eid="JOS 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 13:33" />Lakini likabila la Lawi, Musa ngase jilibaguli nndema wabu, ndaba Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wa Aizalaeli jwaapwagila kubanga bombi bibiya apata hindu yebipiya Aizilaeli kwaka Sapanga wabu.<verse eid="JOS 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOS 14" />
  <para style="s">Nndema uku Kanani gutenda kubaganwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 14:1" />Jenze ndi milema jebaapekiya Aizalaeli mu nndema guku Kanani. Nngolu Eleazali na Joshua mwana waka Nuni, pamu na akolongu bu lukolu lwa makabila ga Aizalaeli babagila Aizalaeli. <verse eid="JOS 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 14:2" />Nndema we hogu babagila sukupega gudugudu ngati Bambu Sapanga eandagalakiya Musa kubanga jagapekia makabila tisa na nusu. <verse eid="JOS 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 14:3" />Musa jabia jagapeki makabila mabeli na nusu ja pandu pabu papabi upandi golipita lyoba wa losi Yoludani, lakini Alawi ngase baapeki pandu pokapi mu nndema hogu. <verse eid="JOS 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 14:4" />Josepu jabiya na bana abeli Manase na Efulaimu henu ndi gapitila makabila mabeli. Likabila la Alawi ngase bapatiki nndema wokapi, ila pe misi jukutama na pandu pukulea inyama yabu ni ilebi yabu. <verse eid="JOS 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 14:5" />Enu, Aizalaeli babagana nndema ngati Bambu Sapanga eanndagalakia Musa.<verse eid="JOS 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kalebu bumpekee musi wa Hebuloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 14:6" />Lisoba limu bandu bi likabila laka Yuda anzendila Joshua ku Giligali. Kalebu mwana waka Yefune jojwabi ju lukolu lwa Akenizi, ampwagila Joshua, “Gukomboka namuna Bambu Sapanga eandagalakia Musa ntumisi waka Sapanga, ndaba jangu nepani na weapa patwabii ku Kadeshi Balinea. <verse eid="JOS 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 14:7" />Panabi na yaka alubaini, Musa ntumisi waka Sapanga jwanduma kujenda ku Kadeshi Balinea, kujenda kugulaluki nndema hogu. Enabuja nunndetila majambu ga hoku ngati enahobalia mmwoju jangu, <verse eid="JOS 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 14:8" />lakini babajenda pamu nanepani bala baasokisa makili bandu, lakini nepani numpwata Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wangu sukuhobaleka. <verse eid="JOS 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 14:9" />Lisoba lela Musa janigila mbamba, ‘Sakaka pandu pu nndema gola pawapeta ke piibiya paku weapa ni kibeleku saku masoba ganga na mwisu. Ndaba wehapa unhobali Bambu Sapanga waku’. <verse eid="JOS 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 14:10" />Lakini henu linga! Sajenu ndi yaka alubaini nu nhwanu tumbuka Bambu Sapanga ejalongila na Musa, mu masoba Aizilaeli pabapeta kulukoba. Tumbuka masoba gala Bambu Sapanga janeka namwomi ngati eanndagila, mbaka sajenu mi na yaka semanini nu nhwanu. <verse eid="JOS 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 14:11" />Lakini nakona mii na makili ngati masoba gala pajanduma Musa. Hata sajenu mi na makili gukuwesa kukomana ngondu au kuhenga lihengu lokapi. <verse eid="JOS 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 14:12" />Enu noba gumbekia nndema ago gogubi ni itombi goguwe Bambu Sapanga janagila lisoba lela. Gweapa gwajogwana lisoba lela kubanga Aanaki atamani amo mu misi mikolongu jejibi nu lumatu, pengi Bambu Sapanga juwesa kunyangati, nanepani naabenga ngati Bambu Sapanga ejapwaga.”<verse eid="JOS 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 14:13" />Ndipala Joshua ampengila Kalebu mwana waka Yefune nu kumpekee musi gwa Hebuloni gubuya mali gaki. <verse eid="JOS 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 14:14" />Ndienu, musi gwa Hebuloni wabiya u kibeleku saka Kalebu mwana waka Yefune mundu ju lukolu lwa Akenizi mbaka lelenu, ndaba Kalebu jukabii juhobaleka kwaka Bambu Sapanga jwa Aizalaeli. <verse eid="JOS 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 14:15" />Musi gwa Hebuloni pa mwandi bugukemika Kiliati Alaba. Alaba jwabii mundu nkolongu kwa bandu boti buku Anaki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 14:15">Nndema woti watama su lukwali sanga ngondu.<verse eid="JOS 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOS 15" />
  <para style="s">Nndema gobaapekiya bandu bi likabila la Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 15:1" />Nndema gobaapekia bandu bi likabila laka Yuda su kupega kula kulengana na akaalongu mundu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 15:1">Kutumbuli upandi guku kusini ja golipita lyoba mbaka mu mpaka wa Edomu. Nndema gu upandi u kusini wabiya lungwenza lu kusini. <verse eid="JOS 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 15:2" />Mpaka wabu upandi uku kusini gwatumbulia mu kona ju kusini ju nhanga gwa mwinyu, <verse eid="JOS 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 15:3" />waendilia upandi u kusini mbaka kikwelu sa Akilabimu, wapetila kulutengu ju lukoba lu kusini, nu upandi u kusini ja Kadeshi Balinea na gwapetila ku Hesiloni mbaka ku Adali na gwayonguluta kujenda ku Kalika. <verse eid="JOS 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 15:4" />Kuhuma hoku gwapeta pambipi na Asimoni nukupwata kalosi kuku Misili mbaka kuhika kunhanga uku Meditelania. Pala ndi pawapeta mpaka u kusini wa Yuda.<verse eid="JOS 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 15:5" />Mpaka wabu uku upandi golipita lyoba ndi wabiya nhanga gwa mwinyu mbaka palosi ja Yoludani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 15:5">Nu mpaka wabu upandi guku kazikazini wapeta pa kona ju nhanga gwa mwinyu palujingali losi lwa Yoludani mu nhanga. <verse eid="JOS 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 15:6" />Ndienu mpaka hogu gwaendaliya ku Beti Hogula na wapetila upandi uku kazikazini ja Beti Alaba mu lilibu laka Bohani mwana waka Lubeni. <verse eid="JOS 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 15:7" />Kabee mpaka hogu waendelia mbaka ku Debili ku ligomba la mangaliku nu upandi wa kazikazini kujenda ku Giligali, musi gowabii pambipi ni indela ja Adumimu ambagu wabii kusini jaka losi, ndienu gwaendalia mbaka ku iliba ya Enishemeshi nu kujomuke ku Eni Logeli. <verse eid="JOS 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 15:8" />Ndienu, mpaka hogu wapeta mu ligomba la Hinomu, upandi u kusini ukitombi sa ka Ayebusi, gobukema musi uku Yelusalemu, kujenda panani ji kitombi sekibii upandi wa golijingi lyoba ku ligomba luku Hinomu nu kuhika mwiligomba la Lefaimu. <verse eid="JOS 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 15:9" />Kuboke pala walongua kwi kitombi mbaka ku kiliba sa Neputoa, kabee wahumila kumisi ji kitombi sa Epuloni. Ndienu mpaka wang'anumbuka nukulongoo ku Bala, ndi tupwaga ku Kiliati Yealimu, <verse eid="JOS 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 15:10" />hoku gwang'anambuka kulongo upandi wa kolijingi lyoba kujenda ku kitombi sa Seili, wapeta upandi wa kazikazini ji lieneu la Yelimu gobukemika Kesaloni, nukuhele mbaka ku Beti Shemesi ambapu wapeta pambipi ni lieneu la Timuna. <verse eid="JOS 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 15:11" />Ndienu, mpaka hogu walongua kabee upandi uku kazikazini wi lieneu la Ekuloni, wayongulata kujenda ku Shikuloni na wapeta pambipi ni kitombi sa Baala nu kuhika mbaka ku musi uku Yabineeli walindakia munhanga nkolongu uku Meditelania. <verse eid="JOS 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 15:12" />Mpaka gu upandi wa golijingi lyoba gwabiya nhanga wa Meditelania. Hela ndi ejabi mipaka joti ji lieneu lebaapekiya bandu bi likabila laka Yuda kulengana nu lukolu lwabu.<verse eid="JOS 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kalebu jukamu misi juku Hebuloni na Debili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 15:13" />Ndienu, Joshua ampekia Kalebu mwana waka Yefune pandu mu nndema waka Yuda ngati Bambu Sapanga eandagalakiya. Ampekia musi uku Kiliati Alaba kabe gumanyikana ngati musi uku Hebuloni. Alaba babii ahoku baka Anaki. <verse eid="JOS 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 15:14" />Kalebu jiibenga kuhuma mmusi homu lukolu itatu lwaka Anaki gobugukemika lukolu lwaka Shesai na Ahimani na Talimai. <verse eid="JOS 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 15:15" />Kuhuma ku Hebuloni jwajenda kwasambuli bandu buku Debili, musi ambagu pa mwandi bugukemika Kiliati Sepeli. <verse eid="JOS 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 15:16" />Kalebu japwaaga, “Mundu jokapi jagukamula musi uku Kiliati Sepeli anzukua kamwali wangu joakema Akisa. <verse eid="JOS 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 15:17" />Enu, Otinieli mwana waka Kenazi ndongu waki Kalebu, jugukamula musi hogu, najombi Kalebu ampekia kamwali waki.” <verse eid="JOS 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 15:18" />Mu lisoba labu la tipati jandoa, Akisa ampwagila Otinieli anndoba Kalebu atati baki litui. Akisa jwabiya panani jiliponda, ejahuluka pai Kalebu anndalukia, “Gupala nugupekia kike?” <verse eid="JOS 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 15:19" />Akisa jwajibua, “Gumbekia mbenge, ndaba gumbeki nngonda gogubi ku nndema nzomu uku kusini, noba gumbekia kabee ni kiliba sa masi.” Kalebu ampekia iliba ya masi yeyabi upandi uku ndonda nu upandi ukumosu gogubii ni iliba.<verse eid="JOS 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misi ja bandu bi likabila la Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 15:20" />Gongo ndi nndema gobaapekia bandu bi likabila la Yuda kulengana nu lukolu lwabu. <verse eid="JOS 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 15:21" />Misi jejabi upandi u kusini nakanopi mu nndema wa Yuda kujenda mu mpaka uku Edomu, jabiya jenze, Kabiseeli na Edeli na Yaguli, <verse eid="JOS 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 15:22" />na musi uku Kina na musi uku Dimona na musi uku Adada <verse eid="JOS 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 15:23" />na uku Kadeshi na uku Hazoli na musi uku Itanani, <verse eid="JOS 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 15:24" />na musi uku Zipu na musi uku Telamu na musi uku Bealoti, <verse eid="JOS 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 15:25" />na musi uku Hazoli Hadata na musi uku Kelioti Heziloni gobugukema Hazoli, <verse eid="JOS 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 15:26" />na musi uku Amamu na musi uku Shema na musi uku Maloda, <verse eid="JOS 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 15:27" />na musi uku Hasali Gada na musi uku Heshibomoni na musi uku Beti Peleti, <verse eid="JOS 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 15:28" />na musi uku Hasali Shuali na musi uku Belisheba na musi uku Biziotia, <verse eid="JOS 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 15:29" />na musi uku Baala na Iyima na musi uku Esemu, <verse eid="JOS 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 15:30" />na musi uku Elitoladi na musi uku Kesili na musi uku Holima, <verse eid="JOS 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 15:31" />na musi uku Sikalagi na musi uku Madimana na musi uku Sanisana, <verse eid="JOS 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 15:32" />na musi uku Lebaoti na musi uku Shilihimu na musi uku Aini na musi uku Limoni. Misi jebapeki jabia ishilini na tisa pamu ni ijiji yaki.<verse eid="JOS 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 15:33" />Misi jejabii mu itombi isokuisoku jabia, musi uku Esitaoli na musi uku Sola na musi uku Asina, <verse eid="JOS 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 15:34" />na musi uku Zanoa na musi uku Enganimu na musi uku Tapua na musi uku Enamu, <verse eid="JOS 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 15:35" />na musi uku Yalimuti na musi uku Adulamu na musi uku Soko na musi uku Azeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 15:36" />na musi uku Salalaimu na musi uku Aditaimu na musi uku Gedeli na musi uku Gedelotaimu. Misi joti jebaapekia ndi jabia komi nu nsesi pamu ni ijiji yaki.<verse eid="JOS 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 15:37" />Baapekia kabee misi ja Senani na musi uku Hadasha na musi uku Migidali Gadi, <verse eid="JOS 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 15:38" />na musi uku Dileani na musi uku Mizipa na musi uku Yokitaheli <verse eid="JOS 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 15:39" />na musi uku Lakisi na musi uku Bosikati na musi uku Eguloni, <verse eid="JOS 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 15:40" />na musi uku Kaboni na musi uku Lahamamu na musi uku Kitilisi, <verse eid="JOS 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 15:41" />na musi uku Gediloti na musi Beti Dagoni na musi uku Naama na musi uku Makeda misi joti jebaapekiya jabiya komi na sita pamu ni ijiji yaki. <verse eid="JOS 15:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 15:42" />Kabe paabekia misi ja Libia na musi uku Etali na musi uku musi uku Asani, <verse eid="JOS 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 15:43" />na musi uku Yifita na musi uku Ashina na musi uku Nesebu, <verse eid="JOS 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 15:44" />na musi uku Keila na musi uku Akizibu na musi uku Malesi. Misi joti jebaapekia jabiya tisa pamu ni ijiji yaki. <verse eid="JOS 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 15:45" />Kabee baapekia musi uku Ekuloni pamu na misi misokopi ni ijiji yaki, <verse eid="JOS 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 15:46" />misi joti ni ijiji yabiya pambipi na Asidodi pikilanda ja Ekuloni nu nnhanga nkolongu uku Meditelania, <verse eid="JOS 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 15:47" />Asidodi na Gaza pamu na misi ni ijiji yaki, mpaka mkolule uku Misili mbaka kumbwani ju nnhanga uku Meditelania.<verse eid="JOS 15:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 15:48" />Misi jejabii pi lieneu li itombi ndi jenze, musi uku Shamili na musi uku Yatili na musi uku Soku, <verse eid="JOS 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 15:49" />na musi uku Dama na musi uku Kiliati Sana gobugukema Debili, <verse eid="JOS 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 15:50" />na musi uku Anabu na musi uku Esitomoa na musi uku Animu, <verse eid="JOS 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 15:51" />na musi uku Gosheni na musi uku Holoni na musi uku Gilo, misi joti jebaapekia jabiya komi na moja pamu ni ijiji yaki. <verse eid="JOS 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JOS 15:52" />Kabee baapekiya musi uku Alaba na musi uku Duma na musi uku Esani, <verse eid="JOS 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JOS 15:53" />na musi uku Yanimu na musi uku Beti Tapua na musi uku Afeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JOS 15:54" />na musi uku Humita na musi uku Kiliati Alaba gobugukema Hebuloni na musi uku Sioli. Misi joti jebaapekia jabiya tisa pamu ni ijiji yaki. <verse eid="JOS 15:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JOS 15:55" />Bandu bi likabila la Yuda kabee baapekia misi ja Maoni na musi uku Kalimeli na musi uku Zipu na musi uku Yuta, <verse eid="JOS 15:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JOS 15:56" />na musi Yezeleeli na musi uku Yokideamu na musi uku Zanoa, <verse eid="JOS 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JOS 15:57" />na musi uku Kaini na musi Gibea na musi uku Timina. Misi joti jebaapekia jabiya ndi komi pamu ni ijiji yaki. <verse eid="JOS 15:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JOS 15:58" />Ahelahe kabee baapekiya misi ja Halihuli na musi uku Beti Suli na musi uku Gedoli, <verse eid="JOS 15:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JOS 15:59" />na musi uku Maalati na musi uku Beti Anoti na musi uku Elitekoni. Misi jebaapekia ndi jabiya sita pamu ni ijiji yaki. <verse eid="JOS 15:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="JOS 15:60" />Kabee baapekiya misi ja Kiliati Baali gobugukema Kiliati Yealimu na musi uku Laba. Misi jebaapekiya jabiya mibeli pamu ni ijiji yaki.<verse eid="JOS 15:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JOS 15:61" />Misi juku lungwenza ndi jabia musi uku Beti Alaba na musi uku Midiani na musi uku Sekaka, <verse eid="JOS 15:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JOS 15:62" />na musi uku Nibisani na musi wa Mwinyu na musi uku Engedi. Misi jebaapekiya jabiya ndi sita pamu ni ijiji yaki.<verse eid="JOS 15:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="JOS 15:63" />Lakini bandu bi likabila laka Yuda ngasebawesiki kwaabenga Ayebuse bababii benei buku Yelusalemu, na mbaka lelenu Ayebusi bakona atama mu musi homu pamu na bandu bi likabila laka Yuda.<verse eid="JOS 15:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOS 16" />
  <para style="s">Ndema wa Epulaimu nu nndema waka Manase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 16:1" />Nndema gobabagulia kibeleku saka Josepu su kupega kula jatumbulia pambipi na losi lwa Yoludani, upandi golipiti lyoba ji kiliba sa Yeliku, nu kupete ku lungwenza lwi itombi yuku Beteli, <verse eid="JOS 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 16:2" />kuhuma ku Beteli mbaka wajenda ku Luzu, na waendaliya mbaka ku Ataloti kobabiya atama Aaliki. <verse eid="JOS 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 16:3" />Ndienu wahelala upandi golijingi lyoba mu nndema wa bandu babakema Ayafuteti, mbaka ku Betiholoni. Gwaendaliya ku musi wa Gezeli nu kujenda kujomuke mu nhanga nkolongu wa Meditelania. <verse eid="JOS 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 16:4" />Ibeleku yaka Josepu yabia, nusu ji likabila laka Manase ni likabila laka Epulaimu, baapekia nndema hogu kuba wabu.<verse eid="JOS 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nndema uli kabila laka Epulaimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 16:5" />Nndema gowabii u likabila laka Epulaimu kulengana nu lukolu lwabu yapakana ana, upandi golipiti lyoba wapeta ku Ataloti Hadali mbaka ku Betiholoni ju kusana, <verse eid="JOS 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 16:6" />nu kujomuke ku nhanga uku Meditelenia. Ku upandi uku kazikazini mpaka wapeta ku Mikimetati nuku upandi golipita lyoba, gwayonguluta kulongo ku Taanati Shilo kokuje wapeta upandi golipiti lyoba mbaka ku lieneu la Yanoa. <verse eid="JOS 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 16:7" />Ndienu, gwaendaliya ku Yanoa gwaalongua mbaka ku Ataloti nuku lieneu la Naala, mbaka ku Yeliku, na gwajomukia mu losi lwa Yoludani. <verse eid="JOS 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 16:8" />Kuhuma ku Tapua mpaka upandi golijingi lyoba mbaka ku nkolule uku Kana nu kujomuke ku nhanga wa Meditelenia. Hogu ndi nndema gobaapekia bandu bi likabila la Epulaimu kulengana na lukolu lwabu, <verse eid="JOS 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 16:9" />pamu na misi joti ni ijiji yebajonzukia mu nndema kuhuma nusu ji likabila laka Manase. <verse eid="JOS 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 16:10" />Lakini bandu la Epulaimu ngase baabengiki Akaanani batama ku musi gwa Gezeli. Akanani haba aendalia kutama ni likabila la bandu buku Epulaimu mbaka lelenu, baalasimisa kuhenga lihengu ngati atumwa.<verse eid="JOS 16:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOS 17" />
  <para style="s">Nndema waka Manase upandi golijinga lyoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 17:1" />Bandu bi likabila laka Manase jojabii nsaliwa ju utumbuli jwaka Josepu, nabombi kabee bapata nndema wabu sukupega gudugudu. Nsaliwa ju utumbuli jwaka Manase ndi jwabia ankema Makili, na atati baka Gileadi, babiya baapeki su kupega kula misi ja Gileadi na musi uku Bashani, ndaba jamanyiki kukomana ngondu nakanopi. <verse eid="JOS 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 17:2" />Bandu bangi bi likabila laka Manase baapekia nndema wabu su kupega kula kulengana nu lukolu lwabu. Lukolu holu lwabiya londo, lukolu lwa Abizaeli na Heleki na Asilieli na Shekemu na Hepeli na Shemida babube boti baabia asaliwa akanalomi baka Manase mwana waka Josepu.<verse eid="JOS 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 17:3" />Lakini Selopehadi mwana juka Hefeli na mwana waka Gileadi na mwana waka Makili na mwana waka Manase ngasebabii na bana akanalomi, ila jabii bana akambomba pena, na ganga ndi mahina ga bana behaba, Mahila na Noa na Hogala na Milika na Tiliza. <verse eid="JOS 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 17:4" />Akakamwali haba bajenda kwaka nngolu Eleazali na Joshua mwana waka Nuni, na aka kilongosi bangi bapwaaga, “Bambu Sapanga anndagalakia Musa jutubagulia nndema ngati emwabaguliya akanalomi bi likabila litu.” Enu kulengana na malagalaki gaka Bambu Sapanga, Joshua jwaapekia nndema wabu ngati ebaapekia akanalomi bi likabila labu. <verse eid="JOS 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 17:5" />Ndipala, likabila laka Manase bilijonzukia kabee nndema mala pabeli nndema wa Gileadi na Bashani gowabii upandi gongi wa losi lwa Yoludani, <verse eid="JOS 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 17:6" />ndaba aka kamwali baka Silofeadi kuhuma mu likabila laka Manase babagulia nndema wabu ngati ebabagulia akanalomi bi likabila labu. Ndema wa Agileadi baapekia likabila lengi leliigali laka Manase.<verse eid="JOS 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 17:7" />Nndema u likabila laka Manase la tumbulia ku Asheli nu kujenda mbaka ku Mikimetati upandi golipita lyoba luku Shekemu, kabee mpaka wabu waendalia kusini mbaka musi wa Eni Tapua. <verse eid="JOS 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 17:8" />Nndema gwa Tapua wabiya mali gaka Manase lakini musi gwa Tapua, goguwe wabi mu mpaka wabiya mali gi likabila la Epulaimu. <verse eid="JOS 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 17:9" />Mpaka hogu waendalia mbaka ku nkolule uku Kana. Misi jejabi upandi u kusini ja Kana jabiya ja Aepulaimu jejuje jabi mu nndema u likabila laka Manase. Kabee mpaka wapeta upandi wa kazikazini ju nkolule uku Kana nu kulindaki mu nhanga uku Meditelenia. <verse eid="JOS 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 17:10" />Nndema uku kusini mu nkolule u likabila la Epulaimu nu nndema uku upandi uku kasikazini labiya likabila laka Manase, mpaka waki wabiya mu nhanga wa Meditelenia upandi wa golijingi lyoba. Likabila laka Asheli labiya upandi uku kazikazini nu upandu golijingi lyoba ju nndema la Manase nu upandi wa Kazikazini golipiti lyoba labiya likabila laka Isakali. <verse eid="JOS 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 17:11" />Ahelahe mu nndema u likabila laka Isakali ni likabila laka Asheli, likabila laka Manase lapata misi ja Beti Sheani na Ebulamu pamu ni ijiji yaki, na misi ja Doli na Enidoli na Taanaki na Megido pamu na bandu bi ijiji yaki. <verse eid="JOS 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 17:12" />Lakini bandu baka Manase ngase bawesiki kwaabenga bandu ba misi heji, ndienu Akaanani aendalia kutama homu, <verse eid="JOS 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 17:13" />Aizalaeli ngasebabii nu makili ngase bawesa kwaabenga Akanani ila pe baahengisa lihengu sanga kupala.<verse eid="JOS 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bana baka Josepu baajonzuke nndema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 17:14" />Ndienu, bandu bu lukolu lwaka Josepu bumpwagila Joshua, “Ndaba jaki gutubaguli nndema gumu pena, ndaba Bambu Sapanga jutupengali twepani na jutuhengiki tubia twabingi ngane?” <verse eid="JOS 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 17:15" />Joshua jwajibua, “Ana mmbii mwabingi ngani hata nndema wi itombi ya Epulaimu ngaguntosi kabete, enu nzendania ku kiholi mu nndema wa Apelizi na Alepai, mwakakesa kiholi hesi nu kulihenga lieneu li lukutama hoku.” <verse eid="JOS 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 17:16" />Bandu bi likabila laka Josepu bajibua, “Sakaka nndema wi itombi gongo ngawatutose, Akanani boti baatama mu ubamba abi na magali gaalenganaki na somasoma, kabee bandu boti baatama ku Beti Shani pamu ni ijiji yaki, na batama kwi ligomba la Yezelieli.”<verse eid="JOS 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 17:17" />Enu, Joshua jaapwagila bandu bi kibeleku saka Josepu bi likabila laka Epulaimu na Manase, “Ena, mwanganya mbii mwabingi nu mmbii nu uwesu nkolongu ngasekupalika mbiya nu nndema gumu pena, <verse eid="JOS 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 17:18" />lakini kabee nndema wi itombi wibiya gwinu. Hata ngati sajenu gubi kiholi, mwikesa nukutama homu nu nndema hogu wibiya winu mbaka upandi gongi. Mwaabenga Akaanani, hata koni abi na magali gaalenganaki na somasoma na abii na makili.”<verse eid="JOS 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOS 18" />
  <para style="s">Nnndema goguhigali nawombi atenda kubagana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 18:1" />Aizalaeli boti akusinyika pandu pamu ku Shilo ebabiya buguwesiki nndema gola bajemika lihema lu kuketangane. <verse eid="JOS 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 18:2" />Lakini gahigali makabila saba ga Aizilaeli gaguge ngase bagabaguli nndema.<verse eid="JOS 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 18:3" />Ndienu Joshua jwaapwagila Aizalaeli, “Boo mwilendalia mbaka lile ili kujingi kutama mu nndema goampeki Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wa akahoku bino? <verse eid="JOS 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 18:4" />Mwaahagula bandu atatu kuhuma kwa kila likabila naatuma pundema woti ili bukugulinga nu kuandika kulengana na makabila gabu na anetila majambu gaki. <verse eid="JOS 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 18:5" />Nabombi bagubaganisa nndema hogu pandu saba. Likabila laka Yuda lihigalia na pandu paki pu upandi uku kusini na makabila gaka Josepu lihigalia na pandu paki pu upandi wa kazikazini. <verse eid="JOS 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 18:6" />Nanamu emwijomuliya kuandika majambu kupete pandu saba hapa nu kunetela. Hapa ndi nipega gudugudu palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, kupete pandu pa kila likabila lino. <verse eid="JOS 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 18:7" />Ila likabila laka Alawi ngalipati pandu pokapi kati jino, ndaba bombi baapeki lihengu lukumpiki matambiku Bambu Sapanga. Likabila la Gadi na Lubeni na nusu jilikabila laka Manase babiya apatiki pandu pabu upandi golipita lyoba wa losi lwa Yoludani. Bapata nndema hogu kupete Musa ntumisi waka Bambu Sapanga.”<verse eid="JOS 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 18:8" />Enu, bandu haba batumbuliya sapwali jukujenda kugusungusa nndema. Kabee Joshua jwalagalakia ana, “Nzendania mu nndema woti na mkaandika majambu ga sakaka kupete nndema hogu gubii boo, na mwikelubuka kuhika kumbwagi, na nepani niipega gudugudu palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga.” <verse eid="JOS 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 18:9" />Akanalomi haba bayongulata nndema hogu woti, baandika majambu gagatosanii pa maeneu saba pamu na misi jaki, nu kukelabu majibu kwaka Joshua ku likambi lu ku Shilu. <verse eid="JOS 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 18:10" />Ndenu, Joshua jwahagula sukupega gudugudu ku Shilu palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, na kwaabaguli Aizalaeli, kila likabila na nndema waki.<verse eid="JOS 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nndema gu likabila laka Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 18:11" />Likabila lu utumbuli kupata nndema sukupega gudugudu labiya laka Benjamini kulengana nu lukolu lwabu. Nndema gobaapekiya bandu haba wabiya pikilanda ji likabila laka Yuda ni makabila gaka Josepu. <verse eid="JOS 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 18:12" />Mpaka waki gu upandi wa kasikazini watumbulia losi lwa Yoludani nu kupete upandi uku kasikazini mwa musi wa Yeliku nu nndema wii itombi kulongo upandi wa golijingi lyoba mbaka ku lungwenza lwa Beti Aveni. <verse eid="JOS 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 18:13" />Kuhuma hoku mpaka waki walongua upandi u kusini kujenda Kuluzu kupete Beteli nukuhele mbaka ku Ataloti Adali, ku kitombi sekibi upandi u kusini ja Beti Holoni juku mosu. <verse eid="JOS 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 18:14" />Mpaka gogubi upandi golijingi lyoba wi kitombi hesi sesabi kusini ja Beti Holoni, mpaka wang'anambuka kujenda upandi u kusini mbaka ku Kiliati Baali, kabee musi wi likabila laka Yuda gobugukema Kiliati Yealimu. <verse eid="JOS 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 18:15" />Upandi ukusini mpaka waki watumbulia mmusi wa Kiliatimu Yealimu nu kujenda mbaka ku kiliba sa masi ku Nefutoa. <verse eid="JOS 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 18:16" />Ndienu, wahulukiya kumosu wapeta pulutengu ji kitombi sesabi pambipi ni ligomba laka mwana Hinomu, lelule labi pandu pu upandi wa kazikazini mwi ligomba la Alepai. Kabee mpaka gwaelala kumosu ku ligomba luku Hinomu, upande wa kusini ukutombi sa Ayebusi, waendalia kuhele mbaka ku Eni Logeli. <verse eid="JOS 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 18:17" />Mpaka gwahuluka kujenda upandi uku kasikazini ja Eni Shemasi, wapetila Geliloti gowabiya gulingalani ni indela ja Adumini nu kuhele mbaka ku lilibu la Bohani mwana mwanalomi waka Lubeni. <verse eid="JOS 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 18:18" />Mpaka waendaliya mbaka ku itombi yuku kazikazini yeibii ku Alaba na wahelala mbaka ku ligomba la losi Yoludani. <verse eid="JOS 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 18:19" />Kabee waendalia upandi uku kazikazini wi kitombi sa Beti Hogula nu kulindaki ku kazikazini ju nhanga nkolongu wa Mwinyu, pandu palujingali losi lwa Yoludani. Gongoo ndi mpaka waki upandi u kusini. <verse eid="JOS 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 18:20" />Losi lwa Yoludani ndi lwabiya mpaka waki upandi golipita lyoba. Mipaka heji jabia mu nndema gobaapekiya lukolu lu likabila laka Benyamini.<verse eid="JOS 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 18:21" />Misi ju lukolu ju likabila laka Benyamini ndi jenze, musi uku Yeliku na Beti Hogula na Emeki Kesisi, <verse eid="JOS 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 18:22" />musi uku Beti Alaba na Zemalaimu na Beteli, <verse eid="JOS 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 18:23" />musi uku Avimu na Pala na Ofula, <verse eid="JOS 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 18:24" />musi uku Kefali Amoni na Ofini na Geba. Misi jebaapekia jabiya ndi komi ni mibeli pamu ni ijiji yaki. <verse eid="JOS 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 18:25" />Misi jengi ndi Gibeoni na Lama na Beeloti <verse eid="JOS 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 18:26" />musi uku Misipa na Kefila na Moza, <verse eid="JOS 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 18:27" />musi uku Lekemu na Ilipeeli na Talala, <verse eid="JOS 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 18:28" />Zela na Ha Elefu na musi gwa Ayebusi gobugukema kabee Yelusalemu na Gibea na Kiliati. Misi jebaapekiya jabiya komi nu nsesi pamu ni ijiji yaki. Hogundi wabiya ulisi gobaapekiya likabila laka Benyamini kulengana nu lukolu lwabu.<verse eid="JOS 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOS 19" />
  <para style="s">Ndema gobaapekia likabila la Simeoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 19:1" />Likabila la pili kupata nndema sukupega gudugudu labiya likabila la Simeoni kulengana nu lukolu lwabu na nndema wabu jebapatiki jabia jiyongwalwiti nu nndema u likabila laka Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 19:2" />Likabila laka Simeoni lapata misi ja Beeli Sheba na musi uku Sheba na musi uku Molada, <verse eid="JOS 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 19:3" />musi wa Hasali Shuali na musi uku Bala na musi uku Esemu, <verse eid="JOS 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 19:4" />musi uku Elitoladi na musi uku Betuli na musi uku Holima, <verse eid="JOS 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 19:5" />musi uku Sikalagi na musi uku Beti Malikaboti na musi uku Hasali Asusa, <verse eid="JOS 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 19:6" />musi uku Beti Lebaoti na musi uku Shaluheni, misi joti jebaapekia jabia misi komi ni mitatu pamu ni ijiji yaki.<verse eid="JOS 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 19:7" />Kabee kwabiya na misi ja Eni na musi uku Limoni na musi uku Eteli na musi uku Ashani. Misi joti jebapekiya jabiya ndi nsese pamu ni ijiji yabu. <verse eid="JOS 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 19:8" />Pamu ni ijiji yoti yeiyongolota misi heji mbaka ku Balaati Beeli kabee bugukema Lama, lieneu lijomu lu upandi u kusini. Nndema hogu wabia baapekia lukolu lu likabila laka Simeoni. <verse eid="JOS 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 19:9" />Kwa ndaba nndema lebapatiki likabila laka Yuda labii likolongu kupete lebalobiki, ndienu nndema gowaigali baapekia bandu bi likabila laka Simeoni, nndema we hogu jabia nkati ji lieneu li likabila la Yuda.<verse eid="JOS 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nndema gobaapekiya likabila laka Zabuloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 19:10" />Likabila la tatu kupata nndema kwi indela ja gudugudu labiya likabila laka Zabuloni kulengana nu lukolu lwabu. Nndema wabu waika mbaka ku Salidi. <verse eid="JOS 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 19:11" />Kuboka hoku mpaka waki gwapiti upandi wa golijingi lyoba mbaka ku musi uku Malala, na wapeta mu lutengu ja musi uku Dabesheti nu kujenda ku nkolule gogubii upandi golipita lyoba ja Yokineamu. <verse eid="JOS 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 19:12" />Ndienu kuhuma ku Saladi, mpaka hogu waendalia kulongo mbaka upandi golipiti lyoba lwa Kisiloti Taboli, na wapeta ku Debelati mbaka ku Yafia. <verse eid="JOS 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 19:13" />Kuhuma ku Yafia waendalia upandi golipita lyoba ku musi uku Gati Hepeli na Etikasini, na waendilia mbaka ku musi uku Nea. <verse eid="JOS 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 19:14" />Ndienu mpaka hogu wayonguluta mu nndema hogu mbaka upandi uku kazikazini na waendalia mbaka ku musi uku Hanatoni nu kulindaki ku ligomba la Ifutaeli. <verse eid="JOS 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 19:15" />Wajonzukia musi uku Katati na musi uku Nahalali na musi uku Shimuloni na musi uku Yidala na musi uku Betelehemu. Misi joti jebaapekiya jabiya komi ni mibeli pamu ni ijiji yaki. <verse eid="JOS 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 19:16" />Jenze ndi milema ni ijiji yebaapekia bandu bi likabila laka Zabuloni kulengana nu lukolu lwabu.<verse eid="JOS 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nndema gobaapekia bandu bi likabila laka Isakali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 19:17" />Likabila lu nsesi lapata nndema sukupega gudugudu labiya likabila laka Isakali kulenga nu lukolu lwabu. <verse eid="JOS 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 19:18" />Nndema wabu wabiya na misi ja Yezileeli na musi uku Kesuloti na musi uku Shunemu, <verse eid="JOS 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 19:19" />Musi uku Hafalaimu na musi uku Shioni na musi uku Anahalati, <verse eid="JOS 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 19:20" />musi uku Labiti na musi uku Kishioni na musi uku Ebesi, <verse eid="JOS 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 19:21" />musi uku Lemeti na musi uku Eni Ganimu na musi uku Eni Hada na musi uku Beti Pasesi. <verse eid="JOS 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 19:22" />Kabee mpaka wo nndema wabu wahika mbaka ku musi uku Taboli na musi uku Shahasuma na musi uku Beti Shemasi nu kulindaki mu losi lwa Yoludani. Misi joti jebapekia jabiya komi na sita pamu ni ijiji yaki. <verse eid="JOS 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 19:23" />Misi jenze ni ijiji yaki, ndi yebaapekia likabila laka Isakali kulenga nu lukolu lwabu.<verse eid="JOS 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nndema gobaapekia bandu bi likabila la Asheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 19:24" />Likabila la nhwanu lapata nndema sukupega gudugudu labiya likabila la Asheli kulengana nu lukolu lwabu. <verse eid="JOS 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 19:25" />Misi jabu ndi jenze musi uku Helikati na musi uku Hali na musi uku Beteni na musi uku Akishafi, <verse eid="JOS 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 19:26" />musi uku Alamaleki na musi uku Amadi na musi uku Mishali. Upandi wa golijingi lyoba mpaka wabii lieneu la musi uku Kalimeli na musi uku Shiholi Libinati. <verse eid="JOS 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 19:27" />Ndienu jang'anambuka kujenda upandi golipiti lyoba nu kujenda ku musi uku Beti Dagoni goguwe wapakana ni likabila la Zabuloni ni ligomba la Ifutaeli. Kabee waendalia upandi uku kazikazini nuku musi uku Beti Emeki na musi uku Nieli nu kuendele ku kazikazini mbaka ku musi uku Kabuli, <verse eid="JOS 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 19:28" />Waendaliya mbaka ku musi uku Abudoni na musi uku Lehobu na musi uku Hamoni na musi uku Kana mbaka ku musi Nkolongu Sidoni. <verse eid="JOS 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 19:29" />Hapa mpaka wajenda ku musi wa Lama nu kuhika mmusi wa Tilu gogwabii guyongalwitwi nu lumatu. Ndienu wang'anambuka kujenda ku musi uku Hosa nu kulindaki ku nhanga nkolongu uku Meditelania. Misi jengi jejabi ndi Mahalabu na musi uku Akizibu, <verse eid="JOS 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 19:30" />musi uku Uma na musi uku Apeka na musi uku Lehobu. Misi joti jebaapekia jabiya ishilini ni mibeli pamu ni ijiji yaki. <verse eid="JOS 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 19:31" />Jenze ndi misi ni ijiji yebaapekiya likabila laka Asheli kulengana nu lukolu lwabu.<verse eid="JOS 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nndema gobaapekia bandu bi likabila laka Nafutali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 19:32" />Likabila la sita lelapata nndema sukupega gudugudu labiya likabila laka Nafutali kulengana nu lukolu lwabu. <verse eid="JOS 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 19:33" />Mpaka waki watumbulia ku musi uku Helefu na kunkongu nkolongu gobugukema mwaloni gowabi ku musi uku Zaananimu, wapeta ku musi uku Adami Nekebu nuku musi uku Yabineeli mbaka ku Lakumu nu kulindaki ku losi lwa Yoludani. <verse eid="JOS 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 19:34" />Kuhuma hapa mpaka wajenda upandi wa golijingi lyoba kulongo ku musi uku Azinoti Taboli, kuhumi hoku wajenda ku Hukoki nu kupakana nndema wi likabila la Zabuloni upandi u kusini, ndienu wapakini kabee nu nndema u likabila laka Asheli upandi wa golijingi lyoba, nu nndema u likabila laka Yuda. Ku upandi golipita lyoba mbaka kujingi nndosi ja Yoludani. <verse eid="JOS 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 19:35" />Misi jabu jejabi ayongulati nu lumatu lwa malibu ndi musi uku Zidimu na musi uku Zeli na musi uku Hamati na musi uku Lakati na musi uku Kineleti, <verse eid="JOS 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 19:36" />musi wa Adama na musi uku Lama na musi uku Hazoli, <verse eid="JOS 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 19:37" />musi uku Kedeshi na musi uku Edelei na musi uku Eni Hasoli, <verse eid="JOS 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 19:38" />musi wa Iloni na musi uku Migidalieli na musi uku Holemu na musi uku Beti Anati na musi uku Beti Shemesi. Misi joti jebaapekiya jabia komi na tisa pamu ni ijiji yaki. <verse eid="JOS 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 19:39" />Heji ndi misi ni ijiji jebaapekiya bandu bi likabila laka Nafutali kulengana nu lukolu lwabu.<verse eid="JOS 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nndema gobaapekia bandu bi likabila laka Dani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 19:40" />Likabila la saba lapata nndema sukupega gudugudu labiya likabila laka Dani kulengana nu lukolu lwabu. <verse eid="JOS 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 19:41" />Nndema wabu wabia na misi jenze, musi uku Sola nuku Eshitaoli na musi uku Ili Shemeshi, <verse eid="JOS 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 19:42" />musi uku Shaalabini na musi uku Aiyaloni na musi uku Itila, <verse eid="JOS 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 19:43" />musi uku Eloni na musi uku Timana na musi uku Ekoloni, <verse eid="JOS 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 19:44" />musi uku Eliteke na musi uku Gibetoni na musi uku Baalati, <verse eid="JOS 19:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 19:45" />musi uku Yehudi na musi uku Bene Belaki na musi uku Gati Limoni, <verse eid="JOS 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 19:46" />musi uku Me Yalikoni na musi uku Lakoni nu nndema gowabi pambipi ni lieneu luku Jopa. <verse eid="JOS 19:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 19:47" />Bandu bi likabila laka Dani ngasebawesa kujuku nndema goabaapeki, ndienu bajenda kwaalapu bandu ba musi wa Leshemu. Baalapula nukujuku musi hogu kuba wabu, nukutama homu nu bugukema nndema we hogu Dani liina la ahoku babu. <verse eid="JOS 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 19:48" />Heji ndi misi ni ijiji yaki yebaapekiya bandu bi likabila laka Dani kulengana nu lukolu lwabu.<verse eid="JOS 19:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nndema gobumpekiya Joshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 19:49" />Pabajomula kubagana nndema woti, Aizalaeli ampekiya Joshua mwana waka Nuni pandu pu nndema pabiya mali gaki. <verse eid="JOS 19:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 19:50" />Ngati Bambu Sapanga ejalagalakiya, Aizilaeli bumpekiya Joshua musi uku Timanati Sela musi gojahagula mweni, musi gogubii mu nndema wi itombi yaka Efulaimu. Najombi Joshua jugusenga musi hogu nu kutama hoku.<verse eid="JOS 19:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 19:51" />Hela ndi ebajomula lihengu lukubaga milema, nngolu Eleazali na Joshua mwana waka Nuni, pamu na aka kilongosi ba makabila ga Aizalaeli babagana milema heji su kupega gudugudu palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga mu litanga li lihema la sapi ku Shilu. Enu, bajomula kubagana nndema.<verse eid="JOS 19:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOS 20" />
  <para style="s">Misi ju kutili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 35:9-34">Esabu 35:9-34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:1-13">Kukomboka 19:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 20:1" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Joshua, <verse eid="JOS 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 20:2" />“Nhagula misi ju kutili ngati enunndagalakiya Musa jumpwagila. <verse eid="JOS 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 20:3" />Ana mundu jokapi jojwikoma mundu kwa bahati mbaja juwesa kutili mmusi gumu kati jaki ili kujepa kunkelubuki mweni. <verse eid="JOS 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 20:4" />Mundu jojukomiki hoju juwesa kutili mu musi gumu kati jaki, nu kujenda pa sengu nu kujema pi litanga laki na kwaalandi aseja sekipitii kwaki. Ndienu anzetakia kujingi mu musi na bumpekiya pandu pukutama pamu nabombi. <verse eid="JOS 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 20:5" />Ana mundu apala kunkelubuki najombi kunkoma ana ampwatiki, aseja ba musi hogu akotuka kumpia joakomiki mundu hoju ndaba ngase akoma sanaule ndaba ngase ansuki toka puutumbuli. <verse eid="JOS 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 20:6" />Jojukomiki jola jwiendilia kutama homu mbaka pabantemula bandu boti buku Izalaeli, na mbaka pa jiikuwa nngolu nkolongu jojabiya julongosa kipindi hesi. Egiijomuka haga mundu hoju juwesa kubuja kunyumba jaki ku musi gojatiliki gola.”<verse eid="JOS 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 20:7" />Ndienu, bugutenga musi gwa Kadeshi gowabi ku Galilaya mu itombi ya Nafutali na Shekemu mwi itombi ya Efulaimu na Kiliati Alaba gobugukema Hebuloni mu nndema wi itombi wa Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 20:8" />Kwii ja losi lwa Yoludani nu upandi golipita lyoba ja musi gwa Yeliku, baahagula musi wa Bezeli gogubi kulukoba lu ubamba na musi we hogu ndi nndema u likabila laka Lubeni. Kabee ahagula musi wa Lamoti ku Gileadi kokuje ndi wakabii musi u likabila laka Gadi na musi wa Golani Bashani mwi nndema wi likabila laka Manase. <verse eid="JOS 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 20:9" />Jenze ndi misi jebijihengiki kwa ndaba ja bandu boti buku Izialaeli na ageni baatama pamu na bombi, ili jokapi jojukomiki mundu kwa baati mbaya jutilila homu ili ajaki bankoma na baabi ni inyela yukulepesa kukoma mundu jola, mbaka mundu jojukomiki pabantemula palongi ja Aizalaeli boti.<verse eid="JOS 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOS 21" />
  <para style="s">Misi ja Alawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 21:1" />Pababia ku Shilu mu nndema uku kaanani, akakilongosi bu lukolu lwa Alawi bajenda kwaka nngolu nkolongu Eliazali na kwaka Joshua mwana waka Nuni na kwa aka kilongosi ba makabila gangi ga Azilaeli, <verse eid="JOS 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 21:2" />bumpwagila, “Bambu Sapanga anndagalakia Musa mutupekia misi jukutama na jejibii ni iyoli yukupugii inyama yitu.” <verse eid="JOS 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 21:3" />Ndienu, kulengana na malagalaki gaka Bambu Sapanga, Aizalaeli baapekia Alawi nndema yenze pamu ni iyoli yukupugi inyama kuhuma mu nndema yabu.<verse eid="JOS 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 21:4" />Lukolu lu utumbuli kupata nndema kukupega gudugudu lwabia lukolu lwa Akohati. Kati jabu bandu kibeleku saka nngolu Aloni baapekiya misi komi ni mitatu kuhuma mu nndema ya makabila ga Yuda, Simoni na Benjamini.<verse eid="JOS 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 21:5" />Lukolu lwa pili kupata nndema sukupega gudugudu lwabia lukolu lwa Akoati baahigali baapekia misi jengi komi kuhuma ku nndema ju lukolu lwa makabila gaka Epulaimu na Dani na nusu ji likabila laka Manase bababia atama upandi golijingi lyoba.<verse eid="JOS 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 21:6" />Lukolu lwa tatu kupata nndema kukupega gudugudu lwabia lukolu lwa Geshoni bapatiki misi komi ni mitatu kuhuma mu lukolu lwa makabila gaka Isakali na Asheli na Nafutali na nusu ji likabila laka Manase ku Bashani upandi golipiti lyoba.<verse eid="JOS 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 21:7" />Lukolu lu nsesi kupata nndema kukupega gudugudu lwabia lukolu lwaka Melali bapatiki misi komi ni mibeli mu nndema gu likabila laka Lubeni na Gadi na Zabuloni.<verse eid="JOS 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 21:8" />Aizalaeli baapekiya Alawi nndema heji pamu ni iyoli yukupugi inyama, ngati Bambu Sapanga eandagalakia Musa.<verse eid="JOS 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 21:9" />Ganga ndi mahina ga misi kuhuma mu ndema ya makabila gaka Yuda na Simeoni gaguge baabagulia, <verse eid="JOS 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 21:10" />lukolu luku nngolu Aloni, bababi alongu bulukolu lwa Akohati jojwabia lukolu lwaka Aloni. Nndema wabu bapatiki ndaba gudugudu juutumbuli jaabukia bombi. <verse eid="JOS 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 21:11" />Baapekiya Kiliati Alaba gobugukema Hebuloni pamu ni iyoli gukupugi yeiyonguluti musi hogu, mu nndema wii itombi ya Yuda. Alaba jwabiya atati baka Anaki. <verse eid="JOS 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 21:12" />Lakini matui ga musi hogu pamu ni ijiji yeibii pambipi babiya bumpeki Kalebu mwana waka Yefune ibiya mali gaki.<verse eid="JOS 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 21:13" />Ndienu lukolu luku nngolu Aloni babagulia musi uku Hebuloni goguwe kabe wabii bugubei kuba musi gukutili mundu jokapi jojukoma ili julama. Kabe baapekia misi ja Libina pamu ni iyoli yukupugi inyama yabu. <verse eid="JOS 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 21:14" />Ndienu baabagulia nndema guku Yatili pamu ni iyoli yaki yu kupugi, Eshitemoa pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi. <verse eid="JOS 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 21:15" />Kabee baabagulia nndema uku Holoni pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi, Debili pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi. <verse eid="JOS 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 21:16" />Kabe baabagulia musi uku Aini pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi, Yuta pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi na Beti Shemesi pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi. Misi joti mu nndema wa makabila gabeli gala gaka Simoni na Yuda gabia tisa. <verse eid="JOS 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 21:17" />Mu nndema ulikabila laka Benyamini bababia lukolu lwaka Aloni baapekiya misi jengi jejuje ndi musi uku Gibeoni pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi na musi uku Geba pamu ni iyoli yaki yu kupugi, <verse eid="JOS 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 21:18" />musi uku Anatoti pamu ni iholi yaki yukupugi na musi uku Alimoni pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi. Misi joti jebaapekiya jabia nsesi. <verse eid="JOS 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 21:19" />Misi joti je baabagulia lukolu lwaka Aloni babube babia aka agolu, jabiya komi ni mitatu pamu ni iholi yabu yu kupugi.<verse eid="JOS 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 21:20" />Bandu babahigali bu lukolu lwa Kohati, babube kabe Alawi baapekiya misi kuhuma mu likabila laka Epulaimu. <verse eid="JOS 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 21:21" />Kuuma munndema wi itombi ya Efulaimu babagulia musi uku Shekemu, musi gowabi gukutili baapekia ni iholi yaki yu kupugi, na musi uku Gezeli pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi, <verse eid="JOS 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 21:22" />na baabagulia musu wa Kibuzaimu na Beti Horoni pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi. Misi joti jebaabagulia jabiya nsesi. <verse eid="JOS 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 21:23" />Kabee kuhuma mu nndema ulikabila laka Dani baapekia musi uku Aliteke pamu ni iholi yabu yu kupugi na musi uku Gibetoni pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi, <verse eid="JOS 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 21:24" />na musi wa Ayaloni pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi na musi uku Gati Limoni pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi. Misi joti jebaapekia jabiya nsesi. <verse eid="JOS 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 21:25" />Nusu jilikabila laka Manase luupandi wa kolijingi lioba baapekia musi uku Taanaki pamu ni iholi yabu yukupugi na musi uku Gati Limonu pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi. Misi joti jebaapekiya jabiya jibeli. <verse eid="JOS 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 21:26" />Enu, misi jebaapekiya lukolu lwa Akohati jejahigali jabiya komi pamu ni iholi yabu yu kupugi.<verse eid="JOS 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 21:27" />Lukolu lwa Galishoni bi likabila la Alawi bapatiki misi jibeli pamu ni iyoli yaki yukupugi kuhuma mu nusu ji likabila laka Manase upandi wa kolipita lyoba. Misi heji jabia musi uku Golani musi ukutili, ku Bashani pamu ni iyoli yaki yukupugi na musi uku Bishala pamu ni iyoli yaki yukupugi. <verse eid="JOS 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 21:28" />Kuhuma ku likabila laka Isakalia baapekiya musi uku Akishioni pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi na musi uku Dabelati ni iholi yaki yu kupugi, <verse eid="JOS 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 21:29" />kabee baabagulia musi uku Yalimuti pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi nuku musi uku Eni Ganimu pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi. Misi yoti jebaapekiya jabiya nsesi. <verse eid="JOS 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 21:30" />Kuhuma mu nndema u likabila laka Asheli baapekiya musi uku Mishali pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi, Abudoni pamu ni iholi yaki yukupugi. <verse eid="JOS 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 21:31" />Ndienu baabagulia musi uku Helikati pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi na musi uku Lehobu pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi. Misi joka jebaapekiya jabiya nsesi. <verse eid="JOS 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 21:32" />Kuhuma mu nndema u likabila laka Nafutali baapekiya Akadeshi, musi gu kutili gowabi ku Galilaya pamu ni iholi yaki yukupugi nuku Hamoti Doli pamu ni iholi yaki yukupugi nuku Kalitani pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi. Misi joka jebaabagulia jabia misi mitatu. <verse eid="JOS 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 21:33" />Misi joka jebaapekia lukolu lwaka Gelishoni jabiya komi ni mitatu pamu ni iholi yabu yukupugi.<verse eid="JOS 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 21:34" />Alawi bangi babahigali bu lukolu lwaka Melali, baapekiya misi nnsesi pamu ni iholi yaki yukupugi kuhuma mu likabila la Zabuloni. Misi je jabiya Yokineamu na musi uku Kalita. <verse eid="JOS 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 21:35" />Baapekia musi uku Dimuna pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi na musi uku Nahalali pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi jumula ja misi jabiya nsesi. <verse eid="JOS 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 21:36" />Kuhuma mu nndema u likabila laka Lubeni baapekiya Abezeli pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi nuku Yahazi pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi, <verse eid="JOS 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 21:37" />Kabee baabagulia musi uku Kademoti pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi na musi uku Mefaati pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi. Misi joti jabia nsesi. <verse eid="JOS 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 21:38" />Kuhuma mu nndema u likabila la Gadi baapekiya musi uku Alamoti uku Gileadi, musi gu kutili, pamu ni iholi yaki yukupugi, musi uku Mahanaimu pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi, <verse eid="JOS 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 21:39" />Ndienu baabagulia musi uku Heshiboni pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi na musi uku Yazeli pamu ni iholi yaki yu kupugi. Misi yoti yebaabagulia jabii nsesi. <verse eid="JOS 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 21:40" />Misi joti yebapatiki lukolu lwaka Melali, haba ndi akaalongu baka Alawi babahigali, jabiya misi komi ni mibeli.<verse eid="JOS 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 21:41" />Misi joti jebapata likabila la Alawi kuhuma mu nndema wa Aizalaeli jabiya alubaini na nani pamu ni iholi yabu yukupugi. <verse eid="JOS 21:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 21:42" />Kila gumu kati ja misi heji jabii na kiholi sukuleke inyama yabu kuyongalota kila musi.<verse eid="JOS 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aizilaeli bugujuku nndema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 21:43" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga jwapekiya Aizalaeli nndema woti gojwaalagila kwaapeke akahoku babu. Nabombi bugujukuwa na kuba gwabu. <verse eid="JOS 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 21:44" />Ndienu Bambu Sapanga jwaahenga atama su lukwali kila pandu punndema ngati ejaalapila akahoku babu. Nga mmbaja jokapi jojaawesa ndaba Bambu Sapanga jwabiya jwaajangati Aizilaeli baawesa abaja babu. <verse eid="JOS 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 21:45" />Ngase labii lilagi lokapi laamboni lejwalagila Bambu Sapanga langa kulihenga. Kila sindu sejwaalagila sapiiti.<verse eid="JOS 21:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOS 22" />
  <para style="s">Makabila gu upandi golipita lyoba gatenda kubuja kunyumba jabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 22:1" />Ndienu, Joshua jwaakema bandu bi likabila laka Lubeni ni likabila laka Gadi na nusu ja bandu bi likabila laka Manase lu upandi golipiti lyoba, <verse eid="JOS 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 22:2" />jwaapwagila, “Nhengiki goti gajunndagalakiya Musa ntumisi uka Bambu Sapanga, na mwanganya nnyetaki nu kuhenga goti ganunndagalaki. <verse eid="JOS 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 22:3" />Wala ngasemwaalei akalongu bino kipindi sokapi mbaka lelenu, lakini mpwatiki malagalaki gaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu. <verse eid="JOS 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 22:4" />Sajenu Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu jwaapekii akalongu bi lukwali ngati ejaalagila. Henu nkelubukania kunyumba jinu mu nndema goampekiya Musa ntumisi guka Bambu Sapanga, jibiya mali gino gogubi kwii ja losi lwa Yoludani. <verse eid="JOS 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 22:5" />Nndingalakiya nu kupwata malagalaki gaguge Musa ntumisi waka Bambu Sapanga gajunndagalakia. Kumpala Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu nu kupwata indela jaki nu kupwata Malagalaki gaki, nnzongana naku nu kuntumaki kwa mwoju gwoti na kwa makili gaku goti.” <verse eid="JOS 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 22:6" />Ndienu, Joshua jwaapengila na kwaaleka ajendania kunyumba jinu. <verse eid="JOS 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 22:7" />Musa jabiya jaabia jaapeki nndema uku Bashani nusu ji likabila laka Manase. Lakini nusu jengi jela Joshua jaapekiya nndema gu upandi golijingi lyoba wa losi lwa Yoludani pamu na alongu babu. Ndienu, kabula Joshua ngasejalei ajenda kunyumba jabu jatenda kwaapenge, <verse eid="JOS 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 22:8" />jaapwagila, “Mwanganya mmbuja mu manyumba ginu koni mmbii na mali gingi, mmbii ni mipugu jingi mmbii na madini ga feza na zahabu na shaba na isomasoma ni ingobu hingi. Ndienu mwakaabaguliya ajinu ganzopiki kuhuma kwa abaja binu.”<verse eid="JOS 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 22:9" />Enu, bandu bi likabila laka Lubeni ni likabila la Gadi na nusu ji likabila laka Manase lu upandi golipiti lyoba balekana na bandu bi makabila gangi ga Aizalaeli guku Shilu, mu nndema wa Kanaani. Bakelubuka mu nndema wabu uku Gileadi, nndema gowabiya gwabu ku malagalaki gaka Bambu Sapanga ngati eandagalakia Musa.<verse eid="JOS 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mesa jukupikii litambiku pambipi na losi luku Yoludani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 22:10" />Pabahika Geliloti gogubii pambipi na losi lwa Yoludani mu nndema uku Kanaani, bandu bi likabila laka Lubeni na likabila la Agadi na nusu ji likabila la Manase lu upandi golipita lyoba basenga mesa ngolongu ju kupiki matambiku pambipi ja losi lwa Yoludani. <verse eid="JOS 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 22:11" />Enu, majambu haga gahikila bandu ba makabila gangi ga Aizalaeli, kubanga makabila gaka Lubeni ni likabila laka Gadi na nusu ji likabila laka Manase gabiya gasengiki mesa ngolongu jukupikii matambiku pambipi na losi lwa Yoludani mu nndema wa Kanaani, nndema wa bandu buku Izilaeli. <verse eid="JOS 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 22:12" />Aizilaeli ebajogwana hela, bakusanyika boti ku Shilu kujenda kukomana ngondu na makabila haga.<verse eid="JOS 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 22:13" />Ndienu, bandu buku Izalaeli baatuma Finehasi, mwana waka nngolu Eleazali jujenda ku Gileadi nuku makabila gaka Lubeni nai likabila laka Gadi na nusu ji likabila laka Manase lu upandi golipiti lyoba. <verse eid="JOS 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 22:14" />Finehasi jwaboka naka akakilongosi komi, kila kilongosi juhumi kila likabila la Aizieli na kila mundu jabii kilongosi mu lukolu lwaki lu upandi golipiti lyoba. <verse eid="JOS 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 22:15" />Nabombi baajendila bandu bi likabila laka Lubeni ni likabila la Gadi na nusu ji likabila laka Manase mu nndema uku Gileadi, baapwagila, <verse eid="JOS 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 22:16" />“Bandu boti baka Bambu Sapanga alaluki ana, ‘Ndaba jakii muhengi hela Bambu Sapanga jwa Aizalaele? Boo, mbona mundei Bambu Sapanga su kusenga mesa ngolongu jukupiki matambiku ajeje? <verse eid="JOS 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 22:17" />Boo, mahakau gatwahengiki ku Peoli ngasegatosike? Boo, mbaka lelenu twakona ngasetulisapisa ndaba ja mahakau gala nu gutung'alisa twepani twa bandu baka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="JOS 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 22:18" />Ndaba ja kike, nkotwiki kumpwata Bambu Sapanga? Ana mundei Sapanga lelenu, kilabu jitenda kutuyome twabandu twaboti tuku Izalaeli. <verse eid="JOS 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 22:19" />Ana nndema gwii gubii gwanga kujetakeka palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, ndienu ndobukiya mu nndema gongo goguwe lihema laka Bambu Sapanga libi na mwakajukua pandu kati jitu, lakini mwaanndeka Bambu Sapanga wala kutukana twepani sukulisenge mesa jengi ngolongu jukupiiki matambiku, jejuje ngajaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu. <verse eid="JOS 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 22:20" />Boo, Akani mwana uka Zela pajasindwa kuhobaleka mu hindu ya Sapi, inyela yaka Bambu Sapanga ngase yutupatiki twabandu twabote buku Izilaele? Kabee Akani ngase jwakuwa pe kanzika jaki ndaba ja mahakau gaki.’” <verse eid="JOS 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 22:21" />Ndipala, bandu ba makabila gaka Lubeni na Gadi na nusu ji likabila laka Manase bu upandi golipiti lyoba baajibua aka kilongosi ba bandu Aizalaeli bala, <verse eid="JOS 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 22:22" />“Sapanga wi isapanga ndi Bambu Sapanga jojubi na makili! Sapanga wi isapanga ndi Bambu Sapanga jojubi na makili! Jwombi jumanyiki ndaba jakike twepani tuhengiki hela. Aizalaeli boti amanyiki hela. Ana tukosii nkotuka kutuleka twabomi. <verse eid="JOS 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 22:23" />Ngati tulisengi twabeti mesa jukupiki matambiku ili kundeka Bambu Sapanga nu kupiki matambiku gu kutini na matambiku gi ilebi au kupia matambiku gu lukwali, enu Bambu Sapanga jututemulaje. <verse eid="JOS 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 22:24" />Ngahela! Twahenga hela su kujogopa ndaba masoba ibeleku inu ihika kukilaluki kibeleku situ, ‘Mwanganya ni mmbi nu ukosi boo na Bambu Sapanga Sapanga jwa Aizilaele? <verse eid="JOS 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 22:25" />Ngase mboniki kubanga Bambu Sapanga ambei kulosi lwa Yoludani gubia mpaka kati jinu mwanganya na twepani ni likabila la Gadi. Mwanganya ngase mwapatiki nndema wokapi kwaka Bambu Sapanga.’ Ndienu bana bino baahenga ibeleku akotuka kundumbali Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="JOS 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 22:26" />Ndienu twasenga mesa jukupikii matambiku jenze, lakini ngasetwasenga kwa ndaba jukupikii matambiku au kupiki matambiku gukutini, <verse eid="JOS 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 22:27" />lakini twapala mesa jukupiki matambiku jenze jikuba sindu su kukombukeka kati jitu twepani na mwanganya ni ibeleku itu ni ibeleku inu ili tunndumbakiya Bambu Sapanga kupete matambiku gitu gukutinii na matambiku gi ilebi na matambiku gu kutama su lukwali ili kibeleku sinu saapwagila kibeleku situ kupwaaga ngaseabii na sindu sokapi kwaka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="JOS 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 22:28" />Twaholalia kabee lijambu ngati heli biipwaga ndaba jitu au ji ibeleku hitu, twaajibua ana, ‘Linga mesa jumalibu jaka Bambu Sapanga ambaju akahoku bitu batenda kujisenga, si ndaba jukupikii panani jaki Matambiku gukutinii au matambiku lakini jibiya alama mu kibeleku situ ni kibeleku sinu’. <verse eid="JOS 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 22:29" />Twepani ngase tupai kunndeka Bambu Sapanga, nu kusenga mesa jukupikii matambiku, matambiku gu kutinii au matambiku gu uwembi au matambiku gangi. Ngasetupai kupiki matambiku pandu pangi ila mu mesa jukupiki matambika gaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, jejibii palongi mu lihema laki.” <verse eid="JOS 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 22:30" />Nngolu Finehasi, akakilongosi ba bandu boti na akakolongu ba bandu Aizalaeli batenda kujetake, pabajowana malobi haga ga bandu bi likabila la Lubeni ni likabila la Gadi na nusu ji likabila la Manase. <verse eid="JOS 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 22:31" />Finehasi mwana juku nngolu Eleazali, jugapwagila makabila gaka Lubeni ni likabila la Gadi na nusu likabila laka Manase lu upandi golipita lyoba, “Lelenu tumanyiki kubanga Bambu Sapanga jubii pamu na twepani twaboti ndaba ngase mundeile. Enu mwaokwi Aizalaeli ili Bambu Sapanga jwaakoma.” <verse eid="JOS 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 22:32" />Ndienu, Finehasi mwana uku nngolu Eleazali pamu na akikilongosi ajaki baatabuka bandu bama kabila gaka Lubeni na Gadi baboka ku nndema wa Gileadi, bakelubuka ku Kanaani kwaka Aizalaeli na kwampwagi majambu haga. <verse eid="JOS 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 22:33" />Bahekalia kujogwana majambu haga bundumbalia Bambu Sapanga Aizalaeli, na ngasebalongali kabee majambu gu kujenda kukomana nu kuhalabana nndema gowabii umakabila gaka Lubeni na Gadi. <verse eid="JOS 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 22:34" />Bandu ba makabila ga Lubeni ni likabila la Gadi bijikema mesa jukupiki matambiku jela ndi alama ndaba baapwaga “Mesa jukupiki matambiku haje ndi alama kwitu twepani kubanga Bambu Sapanga ndi Sapanga.”<verse eid="JOS 22:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOS 23" />
  <para style="s">Joshua jaatabuka aka kilongosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 23:1" />Egapeta masoba gingipi, Bambu Sapanga jwaahenga Aizalaeli apomuliya su lukwali mu kukomana na abaja babu babiya baayongolota. Yoshua jabia nseja jwa yaka hingi. <verse eid="JOS 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 23:2" />Joshua jwaakema Aizalaeli boti pamu na aka kilongosi na akaseja babu, baatemu na akakolongu, jwaapwagila, “Sajenu nepani nuseja wa yaka yingi. <verse eid="JOS 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 23:3" />Mbanganya mboniki kila sindu Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu sejwaahengi milema yoti aje ndaba jinu. Bambu Sapanga wino ndi jojunkomania. <verse eid="JOS 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 23:4" />Nkombuka namuna henummbaguliya sukupega gudugudu milema jejihigali kuba ulisi wa makabila ginu, yani bandu bu nndema gongi banaawesiki kuhuma ku losi lwa Yoludani mbaka ku nhanga nkolongu uku Mediteleniani, upandi wa golijingi lyoba. <verse eid="JOS 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 23:5" />Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, jwaaboa palongi jinu na kwaabenga ngani, nanamu mwagukamula nndema wabu ngati Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wino ejundagila. <verse eid="JOS 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 23:6" />Ndienu nkuba nganganganga nu kupwata goti gagaandikwi mu kitabu sa malagalaki gaka Musa, mwiikotoka hata kulenga kugaleka. <verse eid="JOS 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 23:7" />Mwiijongana na bandu haba bi milema jejihigali pikilanda jinu. Mwiilogo mahina gabu na mwiilogo mahina gi isapanga yabu, wala mwiilapa kupete mahina gaka isapanga yabu, wala kujigungamali. <verse eid="JOS 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 23:8" />Ila mwiijongana na Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu ngati emwalonguliya kuhenga mbaka lelenu. <verse eid="JOS 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 23:9" />Kwa ndaba Bambu Sapanga jwaabengiki bandu bi milema mikolongu na jejibii na makili koni mwaabona na ngase jubii mundu jukuwesa kumpenga mbaka lelenu. <verse eid="JOS 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 23:10" />Mundu wi jumu juwesa kwaabenga bandu elupu jimu, kwa ndaba Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu ndi jojunkomane ngati ejunndagila. <verse eid="JOS 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 23:11" />Ndienu mlilingalakiya nu kumpala ngani Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu. <verse eid="JOS 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 23:12" />Ndaba, ana mundei Bambu Sapanga nu kujongana na bandu bi milema jengi jejihigali pi kilanda jinu, nukujukuu akambomba kwabu na bombi kujukuu akambomba kwinu, <verse eid="JOS 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 23:13" />mmanya kubanga Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, ngajwihendele kwaabenga bandu bi milema jengi haba palongi jino, lakini bombi bibiya lugoji nu ntegu. Kwinu bibiya kiboku su kundimangi na miya jukuntonga mu miu ginu, mbaka pabibiya bunkomiki mwaboti nu kuboka mu nndema gongo gojumpeki Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu.”<verse eid="JOS 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 23:14" />“Masoba gangu gakuwa gahegali mwanganya mwaboti mmanyiki mu mioju jinu kubanga goti gaamboni Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu gajunndagi gapitii. Kila sindu sejunndagi mwanganya kipiti nga sindu hata simwa sanga kupiti sejunndagi. <verse eid="JOS 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 23:15" />Lakini ngati Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, ejutimisi majambu gaamboni goti gajundagila, ahelahe juwesa kundete mabaja goti mbaka junkoma mwaboti kuhuma mu nndema wa amboni gongo gojumpeki ana kugajetake kuhenga gajulagalaki. <verse eid="JOS 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 23:16" />Ngati ana ngase mulitunziki lilaganu laki Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga winu, leandagalakia mulipwata, su kujenda kuitumaki ika sapanga yengi nu kuigungamali, enu inyela jaka Bambu Sapanga itenda kunhiki, na jwitenda kunkoma nyatanyata mu nndema waamboni gongo gojumpeki.”<verse eid="JOS 23:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOS 24" />
  <para style="s">Joshua julonge na bandu ku Shekemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 24:1" />Ndienu Joshua jwagakema makabila goti ga Aizalaeli ku Shekemu, jwaakema aka aseja na aka kilongosi na baatemu na akolongu buku Izalaeli, nabombi bahika palongi jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="JOS 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 24:2" />Joshua jwaapwagila bandu boti, “Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Aizalaeli, jupwaaga ana, ‘Pamwandi pala aka aseja bino atamika kwii ja losi lwa Efulati, biilumbalia isapanga yengi. Aseja behaba baakemika Tela atati baka Abulahamu na Naholi. <verse eid="JOS 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 24:3" />Nepani Sapanga naaboa ahoku bino Abulahamu kuhuma kwii ja losi lwa Efulati nu kundeta ku Kanani, konumpekia ibeleku yingi. Numpekia Isaka, <verse eid="JOS 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 24:4" />najombi Isaka numpekia Yakobu na Esau. Numpekia Esau nndema wi itombi ya Seili ibiya mali gaki. Lakini Yakobu na bana baki bahelaliya ku Misili. <verse eid="JOS 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 24:5" />Monikatai nuntuma Musa na Aloni, naaletila bandu bu nndema gwa Misili malapuli, nu kumpiya mbanganya mu nndema homu. <verse eid="JOS 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 24:6" />Naapiya aka aseja binu kuhuma ku Misili na mwanganya mwahika mbaka ku nhanga nkolongu wa Shamu. Amisili baapwatalia koni abii na magali ga ngondu na alonda baakwela kinyama sebikikema falasi. <verse eid="JOS 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 24:7" />Aizalaeli pabanelila nepani Bambu Sapanga, nabeka lwii kati jabu na Amisili nu kuguhenga nhanga nkolongu gwayekalia Amisili, mwabete mwabona kwa mihu ginu ganaahengila Amisili.’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 24:7">“‘Mwatemi ku lungwenza masoba gingi.’” <verse eid="JOS 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 24:8" />Ndienu nundongua mbaka nndema gwa Aamoli babube atamika upandi golipiti lyoba wa losi lwa Yoludani. Baankoma na Mwanganya, lakini nepani nunhenga mwaawesa na kwaakoma palongi jinu nu kugukamu nndema wabu. <verse eid="JOS 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 24:9" />Najombi Balaki mwana uka Sipoli, bambu juku Moabu jahika kundapu mwanganya. Ankoka Balaamu mwana juku Beoli juhika kunndapi yaambamba mwanganya. <verse eid="JOS 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 24:10" />Ila nepani Bambu Sapanga ngasenunzowani Balamu lakini nepani nunhokua mwanganya su kunhenga Balaamu jumpengila mwanganya badala jukunndigi mbamba. <verse eid="JOS 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 24:11" />Ndipala mwaalobuka losi lwa Yoludani mwahika ku Yeliku. Bandu buku Yeliku bakomana na mwanganya, ngati ebahenga kwa Amoli na Apelizi na Akanani na Ahiti na Agiligashi na Ahivi na Ayebusi. Lakini nepani nunnzangatiya na mwatenda kaawesa. <verse eid="JOS 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 24:12" />Pamwabiya nnzingi mu nndema gola naahenga ajogupa ili mwaabenga aka bambu abeli buku Amoli. Upanga ni mikoa jinu ngasegunzangati sokapi. <verse eid="JOS 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 24:13" />Numpekiya migonda jejabi ngase mwijilemike na misi jejuje ngase mwijisengiki lakini nntama mu misi jeheji, na nkula matunda gi Mizabibu ni Mizeituni jejuje ngase mwa pandike.<verse eid="JOS 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 24:14" />Joshua jaendaliya kulonge, “Enu nde mundumbalia Bambu Sapanga nu kutumaki kwa mwoju gwa mboni na sukuhobaleka. Nndekala isapanga yengi yela yeyuye aka ahoku binu biigungamalia kwii ja losi lwa Efulati kola na ku nndema uku Misili. Muntumikia Bambu Sapanga kajika jaki! <verse eid="JOS 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 24:15" />Ana ngasempai kunndumbali Bambu Sapanga, enu nhagula alelenu nya jomwatumakia, ana isapanga yebiilumbalia akahoku binu kwii ja losi lwa Epulati kola, au isapanga ya Aamoli yeyuye sajenu ntama mu nndema wabu. Ila nepani na bandu bu mu nnyumba jango, twanndumbalia Bambu Sapanga.”<verse eid="JOS 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 24:16" />Hapa bandu bala bunzibua, “Ngatuwesi kunndeka Bambu Sapanga nukuilumbali isapanga yengi. <verse eid="JOS 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 24:17" />Ndaba Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wito, ndi jojutupiya twepani pamu na akahoku bitu mu nndema uku Misili kotwabii twaatumwa, tugabona kwa mihu gitu mahengu makolongu gajuhengiki. Jutulenda nsapwali yitu yoti etwabiya tupeta mu milema ja bandu motwapeta. <verse eid="JOS 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 24:18" />Ndienu Bambu Sapanga jutubokia bandu ba Aamoli boti bababi atama mu nndema gongo. Enu na twepani kabee twantumakia Bambu Sapanga, ndaba ndi Sapanga witu.”<verse eid="JOS 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 24:19" />Lakini Joshua jwaapwagila, “Mbanganya nganhwesi kuntumaki Bambu Sapanga, ndaba jombi ndi Sapanga jwa Sapi ngani. Jombi ndi Sapanga jojubi na wipu, najombi ngajunndekake mwanganya pansindwa kunzetake. Na ngajunndekake mwanganya pa munhenge mahakau. <verse eid="JOS 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 24:20" />Anamundei Bambu Sapanga nukuitumaki isapanga yengi, jwanng'anambukia nukundete malapuli gagang'alisa nu kunkoma, hata ngati junhengi majambu gaamboni haga goti.”<verse eid="JOS 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 24:21" />Lakini bandu bumpwagila Joshua, “Ngahela! Twepani twantumakia Bambu Sapanga pena.” <verse eid="JOS 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 24:22" />Pala ndi Joshua jwaapwagila, “Mwanganya mwabee ndi mpwaaga sekibii mmioju jinu kubanga nnhagwii kundumbali Bambu Sapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 24:22">Nabombi bajibua, “Twepani ndi twetupwagiki gagabii mmioju jitu.” <verse eid="JOS 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 24:23" />Najombi jaapwagila, “Enu, nndekala isapanga yengi yemmbii naku, mu kumpwata Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wa Aizalaeli, kwa mwoju gwii gwoti.” <verse eid="JOS 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 24:24" />Nabombi bandu bumpwagila Joshua, “Twanndumbali nu kunzetake Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu.” <verse eid="JOS 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 24:25" />Henu, Joshua jwahenga lilaganu na Aizalaeli ku Shekemu, jwaapekia mihilu nu malagalaki gukupwata. <verse eid="JOS 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 24:26" />Joshua jugaandika haga goti mu kitabu su malagalaki gaka Sapanga, ndienu jwajukua lilibu likolongu nu kulihimika pai junkongu nkolongu gobugunkema mwaaloni pambipi ni lihema laka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="JOS 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 24:27" />Ndienu Joshua jaapwagila bandu boti, “Nndingaliya lilibu lende lijoini goti gatupwagiki. Lijoini goti gajutupwagi twepani Bambu Sapanga, patwankana Bambu Sapanga lilibu hale liitenda kulonge.” <verse eid="JOS 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 24:28" />Ndienu Joshua jwaaleka bandu aboka, na kila bandu bajenda kunyumba jabu.<verse eid="JOS 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joshua na Eliazali atenda kuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 24:29" />Pagapeta haga, Joshua mwana waka Nuni, ntumisi uka Bambu Sapanga, jwatenda kuwa koni jubii na yaka mia jimu na komi. <verse eid="JOS 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 24:30" />Buntaga punndema pabumbaguli kuba nndema waki, ku Timati Sela kola, nndema gogubii mwiitombi yuku Epulaimu, upandi uku kazikazini ja Gaashi.<verse eid="JOS 24:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 24:31" />Aizalaeli buntumakia Bambu Sapanga masoba goti Joshua pajabi mwomi, na masoba goka ga aseja paatamika baada ja kuwa Joshua, babube bikibweni kila sindu Bambu Sapanga sejwaahengi Aizilaeli. <verse eid="JOS 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 24:32" />Mahupa gaka Josepu gaguge Aizalaeli bagaletiki kuhuma ku Misili bagataga ku Shekemu pandu pajwabia julombiki Yakobu kuhuma kwa bana baka Amoli, atati baka Shekemu, kwi ipandi mia jimu ya madini ga feza. Pandu je pala pabia mali gi ibeleku yaka Josepu.<verse eid="JOS 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 24:33" />Najombi Eleazali mwana waka Aloni, jwatenda kuwa nu kuntaga ku Gibea, musi gobumpekia mwana waka Finehasi mu nndema wi itombi yuku Epulaimu.<verse eid="JOS 24:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 24" />
</usx>